},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal:482:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h: jsuis deg ptin",
["timestamp"] = 1772572107,
["id"] = "s2_2644",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Ya might see familiar faces in Atal'Aman... but I doubt they're as friendly as they once were.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572112,
["id"] = "s2_2645",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Ah, so de hash'ura did find you, my brother. Why did you miss de party? I know you like to dance!",
["timestamp"] = 1772572122,
["id"] = "s2_2646",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Forgive me, sister. I do not feel like celebrating.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572129,
["id"] = "s2_2647",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Why, Zul'jan? Are you not happy for our victory? For de loa returnin'? For your sister becomin' hash'ey?",
["timestamp"] = 1772572134,
["id"] = "s2_2648",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: I am glad we crushed de Twilight's Blade. And I am glad that you are happy.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572143,
["id"] = "s2_2649",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: You do not like that the loa are back. Why, Zul'jan? They have been part of our culture since de beginnin'.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572149,
["id"] = "s2_2650",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Let me ask you, sister. Do you submit to de loa, or do the loa submit to you?",
["timestamp"] = 1772572157,
["id"] = "s2_2651",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: It is neither! Can you not understand dat our relationship with de loa is built on trust, not power?",
["timestamp"] = 1772572165,
["id"] = "s2_2652",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: Yes, but what if we become dependent on them again and they disappear? When they left, it shattered us.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572172,
["id"] = "s2_2653",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Dey left 'cause we almost killed dem--our grandfather and dat villain Malacrass.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572182,
["id"] = "s2_2654",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: I don't mean to yell at you. I understand where you comin' from. Our image of our grandfather is hard to let go.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572188,
["id"] = "s2_2655",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: And to let go of being on our own. But we gotta work with de loa. And de gokinye.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572197,
["id"] = "s2_2656",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan's eyes narrow.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572204,
["id"] = "s2_2657",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: It won't be like it was, Jan. But I won't let you wilt in my shadow. You will still be my right hand. And my brother.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572206,
["id"] = "s2_2658",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "MONK",
["race"] = "Human",
["name"] = "Sânghr-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal:498:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h: a demain ++ ",
["timestamp"] = 1772572214,
["id"] = "s2_2659",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jan says: I... thank you, sister. I hope you are right.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572215,
["id"] = "s2_2660",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "DRUID",
["race"] = "Worgen",
["name"] = "Matrox-Eitrigg",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:500:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: bonne nuit:)",
["timestamp"] = 1772572219,
["id"] = "s2_2661",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Your brother has disobeyed your orders more than once. I know he is family, but should he not bear some consequences?",
["timestamp"] = 1772572222,
["id"] = "s2_2662",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra sighs deeply.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572230,
["id"] = "s2_2663",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: He has been ignorin' his big sister since de day he was born.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572232,
["id"] = "s2_2664",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Zul'jan also be de grandchild of Zul'jin, and so he has power. And he talks well. He has followers.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572237,
["id"] = "s2_2665",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Most of dem are dead because of Mor'duun. De rest? I don't want to splinter de tribe again by punishin' my brother.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572246,
["id"] = "s2_2666",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zul'jarra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Zul'jarra says: Losin' his followers and seein' me become hash'ey... I think dat may be punishment enough.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572255,
["id"] = "s2_2667",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: Your brother would begrudge your relationship with the loa?",
["timestamp"] = 1772572262,
["id"] = "s2_2668",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Lady Liadrin",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Lady Liadrin says: He is his own man. And smart enough to know and face the consequences of his actions.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572283,
["id"] = "s2_2669",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "WARRIOR",
["race"] = "Human",
["name"] = "Bisnina-Archimonde",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Bisnina-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dBisnina-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61800:Player-1302-0CF49EB4:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Tier 4 (Season 1)]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772572288,
["id"] = "s2_2670",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Chel the Chip",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Chel the Chip says: I wonder... Are ya worthy? Or will ya quit before de gifts be earned.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572328,
["id"] = "s2_2671",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Astalor Bloodsworn",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Astalor Bloodsworn says: Let your prey believe you're blind to their strike, then make them regret every misstep.",
["timestamp"] = 1772572360,
["id"] = "s2_2672",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_WHISPER",
["type"] = "MONSTER_BOSS_WHISPER",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.8666667342185974,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "Ambushed!",
["timestamp"] = 1772572370,
["id"] = "s2_2673",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Mordril Shadowfell",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Mordril Shadowfell says: You can't hide from the Void!",
["timestamp"] = 1772572372,
["id"] = "s2_2674",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Mordril Shadowfell",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Mordril Shadowfell says: The Void is always watching...",
["timestamp"] = 1772572385,
["id"] = "s2_2675",
},
