["timestamp"] = 1772573422,
["id"] = "s2_2826",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: To me, young acolyte. Let us begin your tutelage.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573435,
["id"] = "s2_2827",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: This is abundance.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573443,
["id"] = "s2_2828",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Go ahead. Walk to it, and it will heed your call.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573448,
["id"] = "s2_2829",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Well done, acolyte. Within my domains, you shall find abundance beyond measure.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573457,
["id"] = "s2_2830",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: And from many sources, abundance flows... such as this ore. Go ahead. Mine away.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573468,
["id"] = "s2_2831",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: And yes, even enemies. Fear not--this one was summoned for your instruction alone.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573481,
["id"] = "s2_2832",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Of course, harvested abundance serves no purpose within the depths of your rucksack.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573493,
["id"] = "s2_2833",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Approach any Altar of Abundance, and your acquired materials will be contributed efficiently and hastily.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573503,
["id"] = "s2_2834",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: GLORIOUS ABUNDANCE!",
["timestamp"] = 1772573535,
["id"] = "s2_2835",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Uh oh. Your fragile body is reaching its limits here. I will forcibly remove you--for your protection, of course.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573541,
["id"] = "s2_2836",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: An impressive start. Yet, know this: your true education in abundance unfolds through steadfast practice and diligent application.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573554,
["id"] = "s2_2837",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:252608::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Unalloyed Abundance]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772573570,
["id"] = "s2_2838",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Dundun says: Truly abundant deeds shall be met with a gift: unalloyed abundance.",
["timestamp"] = 1772573570,
["id"] = "s2_2839",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Dundun",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
