},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:236761::::::::90:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Tranquility Bloom |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r",
["id"] = "s2_4161",
["timestamp"] = 1772648210,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: When the Haranir first walked this land, they met no welcome--only fangs and fury, as creatures struck with deliberate, unseen intent.",
["id"] = "s2_4162",
["timestamp"] = 1772648225,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Battle was joined, tooth and claw against vine and thorn... but in that frenzy, they teetered on the abyss of madness.",
["id"] = "s2_4163",
["timestamp"] = 1772648235,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Wey'nan saw the point from which his people were struck. Thus, the hunted became the hunter, drawn to the silent cave where truth lay hidden.",
["id"] = "s2_4164",
["timestamp"] = 1772648313,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zaratti Scryer",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zaratti Scryer sniffs the air...",
["id"] = "s2_4165",
["timestamp"] = 1772648383,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The beast lay broken alongside Wey'nan's fallen kin. Had they fallen to its claws or his own? Rage numbed him until the scent of home pulled him back from the abyss.",
["id"] = "s2_4166",
["timestamp"] = 1772648403,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241349::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Fragrant Mushroom Cap]|h|r",
["id"] = "s2_4167",
["timestamp"] = 1772648410,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wey'nan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wey'nan says: No... The rage took hold... consumed me. I won't... can't... let it happen again.",
["id"] = "s2_4168",
["timestamp"] = 1772648416,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: A lesson unmarked is a lesson soon forgotten. So Wey'nan took the remains of his foe in order to make a charm of remembrance.",
["id"] = "s2_4169",
["timestamp"] = 1772648420,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["r"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241611::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Zarat's Head]|h|r",
["id"] = "s2_4170",
["timestamp"] = 1772648422,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Clutching his foe's remains, Wey'nan led his allies to a magical dust-filled cavern. There, the remnants were bound into a charm--balance held in both hand and heart.",
["id"] = "s2_4171",
["timestamp"] = 1772648433,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Wey'nan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
["g"] = 1,
["r"] = 1,
},
["text"] = "Wey'nan says: Help me fill these containers with just the right portions of this magical dust.",
["id"] = "s2_4172",
["timestamp"] = 1772648442,
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
