},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Grognak-KirinTor|h[|cffaad372Grognak-KirinTor|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61581:Player-1127-0B0A6920:1:3:4:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Zul'Aman Glyph Hunter]|h|r !",
