["timestamp"] = 1772657928,
["id"] = "s3_2559",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ney'tar",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ney'tar says: How are my budlings? Are they doing okay?",
["timestamp"] = 1772657943,
["id"] = "s3_2560",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:260705::::::::90:263::11::1:28:373:::::|h[Assistant Botanist Leafy]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772657945,
["id"] = "s3_2561",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ney'tar",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ney'tar says: Now that the budlings are gone, it is too quiet. I was thinking of adopting a grovecrawler.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657945,
["id"] = "s3_2562",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Al'yaat",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Al'yaat says: Akazi told me of your mentor, but I can't forge the weapon without them.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657950,
["id"] = "s3_2563",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ketan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ketan says: Kvotheen is my mentor. Here they come.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657955,
["id"] = "s3_2564",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Al'yaat",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Al'yaat says: We will start with Kvotheen adding the bone, and Ketan adding the fang.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657957,
["id"] = "s3_2565",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Al'yaat",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE",
["type"] = "MONSTER_EMOTE",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.501960813999176,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Al'yaat eyes you up and down, then nods in acceptance.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657957,
["id"] = "s3_2566",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Al'yaat",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Al'yaat says: Now add the sporebat's tail, while Ketan adds the lasher's vines to bind it all together.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657968,
["id"] = "s3_2567",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ketan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ketan says: It is a beautiful weapon, Al'yaat. Kvotheen, as my mentor it is up to you to bring the spear to Elder Akazi. I will meet you there.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657988,
["id"] = "s3_2568",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:257717::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Ka'dani Spear]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772657991,
["id"] = "s3_2569",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Al'yaat",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Al'yaat says: A masterpiece Ka'dani weapon. Not even Akazi will deny it.",
["timestamp"] = 1772657992,
["id"] = "s3_2570",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "MONK",
["race"] = "Human",
["name"] = "Sânghr-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD",
["type"] = "GUILD",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal:1685:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h: cc",
["timestamp"] = 1772657994,
["id"] = "s3_2571",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Akazi",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Akazi says: A fine weapon. A masterpiece indeed.",
["timestamp"] = 1772658007,
["id"] = "s3_2572",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Akazi",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Akazi says: Ketan, a Ka'dani is never afraid of its prey. Your prey today is something to be scared of.",
["timestamp"] = 1772658027,
["id"] = "s3_2573",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Akazi",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Akazi says: You will hunt down the great Radooni, and once the trial is over, you will be one of the Ka'dani.",
["timestamp"] = 1772658033,
["id"] = "s3_2574",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Ketan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Ketan says: It is time for me to prove that I can be a Ka'dani.",
["timestamp"] = 1772658040,
["id"] = "s3_2575",
},
