},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62333:Player-1122-0B2B920E:1:3:5:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Abundance: Harvester]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772749515,
["id"] = "s3_4042",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "MONK",
["race"] = "Orc",
["name"] = "Øskytankul-Archimonde",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "Øskytankul-Archimonde receives loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:251162::::::::90:263::23:4:12779:13439:6652:12701:1:28:3025:::::|h[Traitor's Talon]|h|r.",
["timestamp"] = 1772749593,
["id"] = "s3_4043",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Kvotheen. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?",
["timestamp"] = 1772749593,
["id"] = "s3_4044",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONEY",
["type"] = "MONEY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You loot 17 Gold, 48 Silver, 35 Copper (+34 Silver, 96 Copper)",
["timestamp"] = 1772749594,
["id"] = "s3_4045",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.",
["timestamp"] = 1772749601,
["id"] = "s3_4046",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.",
["timestamp"] = 1772749615,
["id"] = "s3_4047",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.",
["timestamp"] = 1772749622,
["id"] = "s3_4048",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Rokh'zal",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL",
["type"] = "MONSTER_YELL",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 0.250980406999588,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!",
["timestamp"] = 1772749627,
["id"] = "s3_4049",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kul'amara the Fierce says: If de maker of that monstrosity be here, we must stop them. And make sure their creation is put down.",
["timestamp"] = 1772749629,
["id"] = "s3_4050",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "PALADIN",
["race"] = "Human",
["name"] = "Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate",
["sex"] = 3,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
