["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Grodar-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dGrodar-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61922:Player-1302-0C8AD4A9:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ninety Percent is Good Enough]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772819188,
["id"] = "s3_4572",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Xe'ra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Xe'ra says: Illidan, your enemy is far greater than Sargeras and his Burning Legion.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819209,
["id"] = "s3_4573",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Illidan Stormrage",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Illidan Stormrage says: Wonderful. As if they were not strong enough.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819214,
["id"] = "s3_4574",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Xe'ra",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Xe'ra says: The Void is a more potent foe by far. And confronting it is your destiny.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819217,
["id"] = "s3_4575",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Illidan Stormrage",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Illidan Stormrage says: My destiny is not dictated by you, naaru.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819223,
["id"] = "s3_4576",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: The naaru wanted to recruit Illidan to fight the Void? Fascinating.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819228,
["id"] = "s3_4577",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: Let's speak when we return. Digging up secrets of the past has a way of attracting all sorts of attention.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819232,
["id"] = "s3_4578",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: So the naaru approached Illidan and warned him of the Void?",
["timestamp"] = 1772819254,
["id"] = "s3_4579",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: They wanted to recruit him to combat what they believed to be Azeroth's greatest threat.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819259,
["id"] = "s3_4580",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: But the Illidari are not soldiers following orders. We're predators.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819264,
["id"] = "s3_4581",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Allari the Souleater",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Allari the Souleater says: Killers.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819268,
["id"] = "s3_4582",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Leona Darkstrider",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Leona Darkstrider says: I'll meet you there, Kvotheen.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819449,
["id"] = "s3_4583",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Riftblade Maella",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Riftblade Maella says: This area is compromised. It is vital to our mission that you secure it.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819697,
["id"] = "s3_4584",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kifaan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kifaan says: At last... I've found them...",
["timestamp"] = 1772819702,
["id"] = "s3_4585",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kifaan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kifaan says: The Shadowguard readings are coming from that direction.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819710,
["id"] = "s3_4586",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Kifaan",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Kifaan says: My sister Veraan may be lost to the Void, but perhaps we can recover her memory.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819713,
["id"] = "s3_4587",
},
