},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
["type"] = "GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0.250980406999588,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.250980406999588,
},
["text"] = "|Hplayer:Grodar-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dGrodar-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61224:Player-1302-0C8AD4A9:1:3:6:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Tour of Duty: Voidstorm]|h|r !",
["timestamp"] = 1772819966,
["id"] = "s3_4620",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:236761::::::::90:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Tranquility Bloom |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772819968,
["id"] = "s3_4621",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scout Nefina",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scout Nefina says: Whatever you did out there seems to have worked.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819979,
["id"] = "s3_4622",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Sentient Voidwalker",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Sentient Voidwalker says: If we can muster the energy to power them, these domanaar devices will allow us to locate your scouts.",
["timestamp"] = 1772819998,
["id"] = "s3_4623",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scout Nefina",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scout Nefina says: I've never heard of a voidwalker acting so... helpful...",
["timestamp"] = 1772820007,
["id"] = "s3_4624",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["name"] = "Scout Nefina",
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY",
["type"] = "MONSTER_SAY",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 1,
["g"] = 1,
["b"] = 0.6235294342041016,
},
["text"] = "Scout Nefina says: Let's follow for now... but if the voidwalker tries anything funny, we'll be ready.",
["timestamp"] = 1772820010,
["id"] = "s3_4625",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
["race"] = "ZandalariTroll",
["name"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["sex"] = 2,
},
["event"] = "CHAT_MSG_LOOT",
["type"] = "LOOT",
},
["color"] = {
["r"] = 0,
["g"] = 0.6666666865348816,
["b"] = 0,
},
["text"] = "You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:236761::::::::90:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Tranquility Bloom |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r",
["timestamp"] = 1772820019,
["id"] = "s3_4626",
},
{
["recordedBy"] = "Kvotheen-Hyjal",
["typeInfo"] = {
["player"] = {
["class"] = "SHAMAN",
