 says: Innkeeper Areyn is the founder of our estate.\",\"timestamp\":1772236401,\"id\":\"s0_3450\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: For her very first vintage, she picked perfect ten grapes.\",\"timestamp\":1772236404,\"id\":\"s0_3451\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: In honor of old fashions, she then stomped on them to mash and blend the mixture!\",\"timestamp\":1772236408,\"id\":\"s0_3452\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Goldenmist Vintner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Goldenmist Vintner says: Fermentation can take years. But our vintners made a special yeast that acts VERY quickly and efficiently, without compromising quality.\",\"timestamp\":1772236414,\"id\":\"s0_3453\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:256232::::::::82:263:::::::::|h[Bunch of Ripe Grapes]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772236418,\"id\":\"s0_3454\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:256232::::::::82:263:::::::::|h[Bunch of Ripe Grapes]|h|r\",