 Enith, the captain's patched up. Let's study these samples you've brought back.\",\"timestamp\":1772236698,\"id\":\"s0_3490\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Numia Golden\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Numia Golden says: Captain, don't be a hero for the next twenty four hours, please. Rest, have a drink. If the pain gets worse, find me immediately.\",\"timestamp\":1772236702,\"id\":\"s0_3491\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:247753::::::::82:263::11::1:28:3085:::::|h[Empowered Wand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772236724,\"id\":\"s0_3492\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Vedoran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ranger Vedoran says: We'll return with good news, captain.\",\"timestamp\":1772236726,\"id\":\"s0_3493\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Krenn'an\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ranger Krenn'an says: With Vedoran, myself, and Kvotheen, you have nothing to worry about, captain.\",\"timestamp\":1772236728,\"id\":\"s0_3494\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Princess Naz'jena\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Princess Naz'jena says: Arcane thirsts for me!\",\"timestamp\":1772236737,\"id\":\"s0_3495\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:250317::::::::82:263:::::::::|h[Pile of Ash]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772236740,\"id\":\"s0_3496\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Princess Naz'jena\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Princess Naz'jena says: So primitive! Your wand AND friends are no match for me!\",\"timestamp\":1772236741,\"id\":\"s0_3497\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Princess Naz'jena\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Princess Naz'jena says: Nazjak... we will rise again from the depths...\",\"timestamp\":1772236754,\"id\":\"s0_3498\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Vedoran\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ranger Vedoran says: Ugh... the lightkeepers... we... end... like them...\",\"timestamp\":1772236755,\"id\":\"s0_3499\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 40 Silver, 2 Copper (+4 Silver, 80 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772236755,\"id\":\"s0_3500\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger Krenn'an\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ranger Krenn'an says: Hang in there! I've got you!\",\"timestamp\":1772236757,\"id\":\"s0_3501\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\