\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch yells: NEXT!\",\"timestamp\":1772240416,\"id\":\"s0_3691\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: There's nothing I can do to save this--just cover it with sequins and call it a day!\",\"timestamp\":1772240419,\"id\":\"s0_3692\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: It's useless! I can't work like this. These people have no appreciation for my craft!\",\"timestamp\":1772240420,\"id\":\"s0_3693\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: Kvotheen, turn them away!\",\"timestamp\":1772240435,\"id\":\"s0_3694\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gaari\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gaari says: My ask is humble. I have had this cloak since the days of the Shattered Sun, and it needs a repair.\",\"timestamp\":1772240441,\"id\":\"s0_3695\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: This cloak is pure Thalassian arcanoweave! And some of the finest I've ever seen...\",\"timestamp\":1772240447,\"id\":\"s0_3696\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: ...fine. I'll do the repair, but only for the chance to work on such a marvelous garment.\",\"timestamp\":1772240453,\"id\":\"s0_3697\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch says: I am going quite far out of my way for this, you know.\",\"timestamp\":1772240478,\"id\":\"s0_3698\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gaari\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gaari says: I insist upon accompanying you. Your trouble is my trouble.\",\"timestamp\":1772240481,\"id\":\"s0_3699\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Solwin Brightstitch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Solwin Brightstitch blushes but does not otherwise reply.\",\"timestamp\":1772240486,\"id\":\"s0_3700\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:238538::::::::82:263::::1:28:3615:::::|h[Pristine Potion]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772240525,\"id\":\"s0_3701\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3256:0|h[Artis