opper (+2 Silver, 99 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s0_4647\",\"timestamp\":1772293671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264255::::::::85:263::11::1:28:3086:::::|h[Amani Trophy Frame]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4648\",\"timestamp\":1772293686},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:260459::::::::85:263::11:3:13573:6652:13668:2:9:85:28:3086:::::|h[Gaahl's Gorget]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4649\",\"timestamp\":1772293700},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Now that the shrines are lit, the eagles are on the move.\",\"id\":\"s0_4650\",\"timestamp\":1772293705},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De eagles be flying towards de temple at the top of de mountain. Maybe dat is an invitation.\",\"id\":\"s0_4651\",\"timestamp\":1772293710},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:248569::::::::85:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:85:28:3086:::::|h[Skyblessed Chainmail]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4652\",\"timestamp\":1772293710},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Haven't been back to de temple since I was a child. There be nothin' there but birds an' bramble.\",\"id\":\"s0_4653\",\"timestamp\":1772293735},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Kinduru wanted us to leave an offering. De heads of our enemies will do nicely.\",\"id\":\"s0_4654\",\"timestamp\":1772293753},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Justhunt-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Justhunt-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Justhunt-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62137:Player-1335-06F2340A:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[I'm Not Trapped In Here With You]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4655\",\"timestamp\":1772293761},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: If Kinduru is correct, it may be possible to contact the loa--by walking this path of \\\"hash'ey.\\\"\",\"id\":\"s0_4656\",\"timestamp\":1772293770},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: And be one step closer to ridding Zul'Aman of the Twilight's Blade.\",\"id\":\"s0_4657\",\"timestamp\":1772293778},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Yes, gokinye. We are closer to achievin' your goals. Let's go.\",\"id\":\"s0_4658\",\"timestamp\":1772293783},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Wait... I did not mean to... Zul'jarra, becoming the hash'ey will be a great achievement.\",\"id\":\"s0_4659\",\"timestamp\":1772293789},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Now you try to flatter me? I know why you here. To protect your precious golden fields of Eversong.\",\"id\":\"s0_4660\",\"timestamp\":1772293798},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Do not pretend to care about me or de Amani.\",\"id\":\"s0_4661\",\"timestamp\":1772293806},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Enough, Zul'jarra. I admit that my past keeps me from... empathizing fully with your people.\",\"id\":\"s0_4662\",\"timestamp\":1772293810},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I told you that I fought against your grandfather.\",\"id\":\"s0_4663\",\"timestamp\":1772293819},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: But I did not tell you that he held me captive and tortured me. And tortured and killed many of my peers.\",\"id\":\"s0_4664\",\"timestamp\":1772293823},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: That part of my past led me down a path I am not proud of.\",\"id\":\"s0_4665\",\"timestamp\":1772293831},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: And, as strange as it seems, I see some of myself in your plight. And want you to become closer to your gods.\",\"id\":\"s0_4666\",\"timestamp\":1772293837},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Now! Kvotheen and I are your hash'ura. We will attend you...\",\"id\":\"s0_4667\",\"timestamp\":1772293846},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Ha ha ha ha ha. You're a funny one. Straight as a spear but thick as a pango-hide shield.\",\"id\":\"s0_4668\",\"timestamp\":1772293852},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: If you say that's what guides your hand, I believe you. Your counsel has been good. And you bring strong company.\",\"id\":\"s0_4669\",\"timestamp\":1772293859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: But dat don't make us friends.\",\"id\":\"s0_4670\",\"timestamp\":1772293867},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Dis journey gonna try us all, so we should get goin' soon, eh hash'ura?\",\"id\":\"s0_4671\",\"timestamp\":1772293870},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde|h[|cffffffffHèlio-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-1302-09C18F6E:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4672\",\"timestamp\":1772293888},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-1390-0D1876B7:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4673\",\"timestamp\":1772293895},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"???\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"??? says: Ha ha ha! The heads of our enemies. A tribute to our victory.\",\"id\":\"s0_4674\",\"timestamp\":1772293912},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"???\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"??? says: All that seek my favor must climb high but not be afraid to fall.\",\"id\":\"s0_4675\",\"timestamp\":1772293941},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De trial... Kinduru brought me here as a child... I remember!\",\"id\":\"s0_4676\",\"timestamp\":1772293951},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal:782:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h: j'ai bien aimé cette zone/campagne Zul'aman !\",\"id\":\"s0_4677\",\"timestamp\":1772293966},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Kinduru... I hope you are right. For de Amani!\",\"id\":\"s0_4678\",\"timestamp\":1772293969},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Wait, Zul'jarra! Are you mad?\",\"id\":\"s0_4679\",\"timestamp\":1772293977},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:785:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: de même ^^\",\"id\":\"s0_4680\",\"timestamp\":1772294008},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Disyxoine-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Disyxoine-KhazModan:787:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Disyxoine|r]|h: Hello tout le monde \",\"id\":\"s0_4681\",\"timestamp\":1772294073},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:788:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: salut\",\"id\":\"s0_4682\",\"timestamp\":1772294080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Disyxoine-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Disyxoine-KhazModan:789:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Disyxoine|r]|h: coomment ça va ? \",\"id\":\"s0_4683\",\"timestamp\":1772294103},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:790:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: plutot pas mal et toi ?\",\"id\":\"s0_4684\",\"timestamp\":1772294119},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal:791:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h: jsuis en plein dans la campagne de zulaman et j'adore aussi\",\"id\":\"s0_4685\",\"timestamp\":1772294143},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:792:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: ^^\",\"id\":\"s0_4686\",\"timestamp\":1772294153},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Disyxoine-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Disyxoine-KhazModan:793:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Disyxoine|r]|h: je dirais qu'une chose midnight dinguerie :)\",\"id\":\"s0_4687\",\"timestamp\":1772294165},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Grodar-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Grodar-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dGrodar-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-1302-0C8AD4A9:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4688\",\"timestamp\":1772294167},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal:795:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h: surtout que j'avais adoré Zandalar a BFA\",\"id\":\"s0_4689\",\"timestamp\":1772294177},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:796:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: pour l'instant je suis plutot satisfaite aussi \",\"id\":\"s0_4690\",\"timestamp\":1772294200},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal:797:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h: ceci dit Bwonsamdi me manque\",\"id\":\"s0_4691\",\"timestamp\":1772294205},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde:798:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffHèlio|r]|h: c'est vrai qu'il etait assez sympa le pere Bwonsamdi ^^\",\"id\":\"s0_4692\",\"timestamp\":1772294374},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62270:Player-1390-0D1876B7:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: One for Altar]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4693\",\"timestamp\":1772294538},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akil'zon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Akil'zon says: Next you must seek Halazzi's blessing. He is hidden, but his speaker can help you find him.\",\"id\":\"s0_4694\",\"timestamp\":1772294603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De Witherbark loa speakers are dead. But maybe Kul'amara can help.\",\"id\":\"s0_4695\",\"timestamp\":1772294614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: You seem... pensive, Zul'jarra. Are you not relieved Akil'zon graced us with her favor?\",\"id\":\"s0_4696\",\"timestamp\":1772294648},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: What is dis, elf? You become my hash'ura and you think you can ask me personal questions now?\",\"id\":\"s0_4697\",\"timestamp\":1772294656},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Zul'jarra, I see that something is burdening you. I genuinely want to help.\",\"id\":\"s0_4698\",\"timestamp\":1772294662},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: If I share my feelings, you gonna tell me how to rid myself of de hot rage and cold shame at what Akil'zon told us?\",\"id\":\"s0_4699\",\"timestamp\":1772294668},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: About your grandfather, Zul'jin?\",\"id\":\"s0_4700\",\"timestamp\":1772294676},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Yes. Dat my grandfather's rage made him betray de loa, try to take their power, and cut us off from our gods!\",\"id\":\"s0_4701\",\"timestamp\":1772294679},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Rage is a powerful emotion. My people were once consumed by it as well.\",\"id\":\"s0_4702\",\"timestamp\":1772294688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I was consumed by rage at Zul'jin for what he did and sought retribution against him for years.\",\"id\":\"s0_4703\",\"timestamp\":1772294694},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Zul'jin, I realized, was the same. He had good reason for his rage. And it festered and controlled him.\",\"id\":\"s0_4704\",\"timestamp\":1772294702},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Are you saying I should feel sorry for him? Dat he should be pardoned because he had big feelings?\",\"id\":\"s0_4705\",\"timestamp\":1772294711},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: No. I'm saying there is a lesson to be learned. Let go of your rage at the loa and at Zul'jin. It will lead you off your path.\",\"id\":\"s0_4706\",\"timestamp\":1772294718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Hmph. You have again given me good counsel. And perhaps we are more alike than we seem.\",\"id\":\"s0_4707\",\"timestamp\":1772294729},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Herbalism has increased to 40.\",\"id\":\"s0_4708\",\"timestamp\":1772294753},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236770::::::::85:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Sanguithorn |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s0_4709\",\"timestamp\":1772294753},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Aramasu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aramasu-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Aramasu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41960:Player-1390-0D58EB43:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Murder Row]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s0_4710\",\"timestamp\":1772294787},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:256164::::::::85:263:::::::::|h[Broken Oar]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4711\",\"timestamp\":1772294868},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:255428::::::::85:263::::1:28:3321:::::|h[Tolbani's Medicine Satchel]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s0_4712\",\"timestamp\":1772294868},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Grodar-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"typ