ys: We are de strongest! You done good, Kvotheen.\",\"id\":\"s1_2545\",\"timestamp\":1772315963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: I'll take de trophies now. Meet me back down de hill.\",\"id\":\"s1_2546\",\"timestamp\":1772315971},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: Don't keep me waitin' long. De other Amani will want to see all de trophies we got!\",\"id\":\"s1_2547\",\"timestamp\":1772315999},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: Uh... maybe you're right. Maybe I don't wanna be dealin' with someone like you.\",\"id\":\"s1_2548\",\"timestamp\":1772316023},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo yells: No! Only one of us gets de glory, and it's gonna be me!\",\"id\":\"s1_2549\",\"timestamp\":1772316028},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kel'vujo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kel'vujo says: H-hold on! We can split de trophies... I was just yankin' your tusks!\",\"id\":\"s1_2550\",\"timestamp\":1772316039},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntmaster Jinki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.62352943420410