IQ3:|Hitem:236951::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Mote of Wild Magic]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_2639\",\"timestamp\":1772317112},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: No Witherbark will be forgotten! I will meet you within Maisara Caverns.\",\"id\":\"s1_2640\",\"timestamp\":1772317187},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seeker Crikkash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Seeker Crikkash says: No need to panic, friends. We have a letter from your elder approving our study of the artifacts here.\",\"id\":\"s1_2641\",\"timestamp\":1772317202},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: A letter? Our elders have said nothing about allowing large-shelled invaders here. You must leave!\",\"id\":\"s1_2642\",\"timestamp\":1772317208},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62270:Player-1122-0B2B920E:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: One for Altar]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2643\",\"timestamp\":1772317218},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seeker Crikkash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Seeker Crikkash says: Find Elder Ren'zen of the Witherbark. There must be a misunderstanding.\",\"id\":\"s1_2644\",\"timestamp\":1772317231},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Don't move!\",\"id\":\"s1_2645\",\"timestamp\":1772317235},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seeker Crikkash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Seeker Crikkash says: Oh, wouldn't dream of it, young one. We'll wait patiently.\",\"id\":\"s1_2646\",\"timestamp\":1772317237},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s1_2647\",\"timestamp\":1772317257},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Voltarynn-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Voltarynn-Dalaran|h[|cff33937fVoltarynn-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61857:Player-1621-0B3D5570:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Voidstorm]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2648\",\"timestamp\":1772317298},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vun'zarah\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Vun'zarah says: De Witherbark know little of Jan'alai, but their eccentric loa speaker still lives at de temple to de east.\",\"id\":\"s1_2649\",\"timestamp\":1772317345},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Voltarynn-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Voltarynn-Dalaran|h[|cff33937fVoltarynn-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:16566:Player-1621-0B3D5570:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Great Shot!]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2650\",\"timestamp\":1772317373},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Bisnina-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bisnina-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dBisnina-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-1302-0CF49EB4:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2651\",\"timestamp\":1772317373},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Heh. I know all 'bout \\\"eccentric\\\" loa speakers. Thank you, Vun'zarah. Maybe dis trial will be easier.\",\"id\":\"s1_2652\",\"timestamp\":1772317380},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hav'kalo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hav'kalo says: You shoulda seen de fish. Dey was bigger than me harpoon!\",\"id\":\"s1_2653\",\"timestamp\":1772317396},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Ren'zen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elder Ren'zen says: De tortollan can stay for now. Rare for someone to be as stubborn as me!\",\"id\":\"s1_2654\",\"timestamp\":1772317423},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Ren'zen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Elder Reh'shen laughs to himself.\",\"id\":\"s1_2655\",\"timestamp\":1772317428},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nerunda\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nerunda says: Leavin'... just when I was gettin' supper done. Don't have time for de girl's hidin'!\",\"id\":\"s1_2656\",\"timestamp\":1772317446},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Oban\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Oban says: Maybe just as well she left. She's not like her sister. She's a wild one with no respect for her elders.\",\"id\":\"s1_2657\",\"timestamp\":1772317478},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Do ya know much about de Witherbark, Zandalari?\",\"id\":\"s1_2658\",\"timestamp\":1772317482},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nerunda\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nerunda says: Father! Dat is just how she is. Say dat again about your grandchild, and I pour your hot supper on your head.\",\"id\":\"s1_2659\",\"timestamp\":1772317485},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: I've heard some of dem talkin' about their Hinterlands brethren in de huts. These walls are thin. While ya search, just keep your ears open for mentions of Shadra.\",\"id\":\"s1_2660\",\"timestamp\":1772317584},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rajom Swiftspear\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Rajom Swiftspear says: Don't touch my huntin' spears unless you're seekin' a lesson on 'em. Dey are tipped in poison from Skulk Rock.\",\"id\":\"s1_2661\",\"timestamp\":1772317605},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Haz'kel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Haz'kel says: Kanza? I saw her runnin' toward de wood bridge where we all play.\",\"id\":\"s1_2662\",\"timestamp\":1772317630},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Haz'kel\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Haz'kel says: Good luck findin' her. If you do, she'll growl at you. Or just run away again!\",\"id\":\"s1_2663\",\"timestamp\":1772317634},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Headhunter Og'beh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Headhunter Og'beh says: Admirin' my trophy? Wilderhammer dwarves foolishly attacked our villages. I brought it with me from de south to Zul'Aman!\",\"id\":\"s1_2664\",\"timestamp\":1772317655},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: When we fled de Hinterlands, I brought some of de recipes and relics of Zun'watha with me, but de ingredients are very different here.\",\"id\":\"s1_2665\",\"timestamp\":1772317690},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Halazzi is de Loa of de Hunt, and Shadra is his rival. Huntin' for Shadra might appeal to him.\",\"id\":\"s1_2666\",\"timestamp\":1772317766},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halazzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halazzi says: Ah, a request to see the invisible... an interesting hunt is ahead of you.\",\"id\":\"s1_2667\",\"timestamp\":1772317779},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61640:Player-1390-08FA49D3:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Nexus-Point Xenas]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2668\",\"timestamp\":1772317782},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halazzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halazzi says: I bestow on you de power to see de hidden eyes of Shadra.\",\"id\":\"s1_2669\",\"timestamp\":1772317784},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Do you see them? Chase de spies out of this village!\",\"id\":\"s1_2670\",\"timestamp\":1772317792},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: I will keep both eyes on de Witherbark here while you are at Halazzi's temple.\",\"id\":\"s1_2671\",\"timestamp\":1772317846},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:588:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h: c'est worth de la remplacer quand la cape leg ?\",\"id\":\"s1_2672\",\"timestamp\":1772317907},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:589:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: ilvl\",\"id\":\"s1_2673\",\"timestamp\":1772317914},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:590:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: ilvl prio \",\"id\":\"s1_2674\",\"timestamp\":1772317931},{\"recordedBy\":\"K