6999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:595:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h: Ouais j'imagine mais à ilvl équivalent jpense pas ca vaut le coup\",\"id\":\"s1_2679\",\"timestamp\":1772317972},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Hitni-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hitni-Archimonde|h[|cff3fc7ebHitni-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61910:Player-1302-0C3B1C87:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Mrglgrgl of Grglmrgl]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2680\",\"timestamp\":1772317998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"name\":\"Hitni-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hitni-Archimonde:597:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebHitni|r]|h: Mrglglrlglr\",\"id\":\"s1_2681\",\"timestamp\":1772318013},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-1390-08FA49D3:1:2:28:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_2682\",\"timestamp\":1772318096},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":