":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241013::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Zapgut Eel Stomach]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772322935,\"id\":\"s1_2822\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Old Amani Pot]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772322949,\"id\":\"s1_2823\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241014::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Blisterskin Kelp]|h|rx12\",\"timestamp\":1772322964,\"id\":\"s1_2824\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Start with de eel stomachs. Squeeze dem until dey release all their juices.\",\"timestamp\":1772322997,\"id\":\"s1_2825\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Now crush de blisterskin kelp. Only use de tip of de leaves. Dat's where most of de poison gathers.\",\"timestamp\":1772323007,\"id\":\"s1_2826\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: I've brought boar for you to butcher. We'll lather de blistereel paste as seasonin'.\",\"timestamp\":1772323030,\"id\":\"s1_2827\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Now add everything to a skewer. Cook it for a while to bring de two poisons together.\",\"timestamp\":1772323042,\"id\":\"s1_2828\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Dat looks good. You've cooked it long enough.\",\"timestamp\":1772323055,\"id\":\"s1_2829\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gushu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gushu says: Ah, that smells sharp and tangy!\",\"timestamp\":1772323058,\"id\":\"s1_2830\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gushu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gushu says: Well, down the hatch!\",\"timestamp\":1772323061,\"id\":\"s1_2831\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gushu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Gushu tears off a bite of Blistereel Boar meat.\",\"timestamp\":1772323063,\"id\":\"s1_2832\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gushu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gushu says: Gah! My limbs are all tingly! Was that the paralysis you mentioned, Amaxi?\",\"timestamp\":1772323068,\"id\":\"s1_2833\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: Interestin'... It had almost no effect on you. Dat much blistereel paste would have paralyzed me for two days.\",\"timestamp\":1772323072,\"id\":\"s1_2834\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Gushu\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Gushu says: Fascinating! I'll make note of that in my cookbook.\",\"timestamp\":1772323079,\"id\":\"s1_2835\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amaxi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Amaxi says: And I'll develop you a recipe dat will help you feel de full effects.\",\"timestamp\":1772323083,\"id\":\"s1_2836\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260670::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Bloody Broken Beak]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323122,\"id\":\"s1_2837\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323122,\"id\":\"s1_2838\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: De heat of summer was at its peak when...\",\"timestamp\":1772323165,\"id\":\"s1_2839\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: A raging dragonhawk rained chaos down on de village.\",\"timestamp\":1772323167,\"id\":\"s1_2840\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: De Witherbark defended their home proudly.\",\"timestamp\":1772323173,\"id\":\"s1_2841\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: A dense mist had covered de forest...\",\"timestamp\":1772323183,\"id\":\"s1_2842\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: Elven assassins descended upon de Witherbark.\",\"timestamp\":1772323186,\"id\":\"s1_2843\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: A lone Witherbark warrior won de day.\",\"timestamp\":1772323192,\"id\":\"s1_2844\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: A dense mist had covered de forest...\",\"timestamp\":1772323201,\"id\":\"s1_2845\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: Countless murlocs besieged de Witherbark!\",\"timestamp\":1772323202,\"id\":\"s1_2846\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: It came at great cost, but de Witherbark triumphed.\",\"timestamp\":1772323206,\"id\":\"s1_2847\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: There once was a great fire...\",\"timestamp\":1772323211,\"id\":\"s1_2848\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: It was in de aftermath of war...\",\"timestamp\":1772323212,\"id\":\"s1_2849\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: Countless murlocs besieged de Witherbark!\",\"timestamp\":1772323214,\"id\":\"s1_2850\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: A bear de size of a mammoth attacked!\",\"timestamp\":1772323215,\"id\":\"s1_2851\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: And no Witherbark can forget dat fateful day.\",\"timestamp\":1772323215,\"id\":\"s1_2852\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Visitor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Visitor says: De Witherbark were outnumbered, but dat's just how we like it. We survived by de skin of our tusks.\",\"timestamp\":1772323216,\"id\":\"s1_2853\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Seeker Crikkash\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Seeker Crikkash says: I'll meet you in Witherbark Village with the pot. I can't wait to see the look on Ren'zen's face when he sees it!\",\"timestamp\":1772323238,\"id\":\"s1_2854\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"timestamp\":1772323247,\"id\":\"s1_2855\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Filo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Filo titters happily in greeting then tucks into his plate.\",\"timestamp\":1772323267,\"id\":\"s1_2856\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: Filo...\",\"timestamp\":1772323271,\"id\":\"s1_2857\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: My sister... with you?\",\"timestamp\":1772323273,\"id\":\"s1_2858\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Filo nods slowly, his mouth full of thorncaps.\",\"timestamp\":1772323275,\"id\":\"s1_2859\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Janaka\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Janaka smiles warmly when she sees Kanza.\",\"timestamp\":1772323278,\"id\":\"s1_2860\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: Are you... okay?\",\"timestamp\":1772323281,\"id\":\"s1_2861\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Janaka\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Janaka smiles and nods but then puts her hands on her hips.\",\"timestamp\":1772323283,\"id\":\"s1_2862\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: I know I should talk to mama. But when I use my voice... all I hear is you.\",\"timestamp\":1772323287,\"id\":\"s1_2863\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Filo\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Filo yawns and stretches and begins to walk away.\",\"timestamp\":1772323292,\"id\":\"s1_2864\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: Do you have to go?\",\"timestamp\":1772323295,\"id\":\"s1_2865\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Janaka\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Janaka nods and waves at Kanza as she sets off to follow Filo.\",\"timestamp\":1772323297,\"id\":\"s1_2866\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kanza\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kanza says: Goodbye, sister. I'll see you again... someday.\",\"timestamp\":1772323301,\"id\":\"s1_2867\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Brek\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Brek says: De livin' flame be gone, burned in many hearts. Purify yaself, an' it will rise!\",\"timestamp\":1772323401,\"id\":\"s1_2868\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Brek\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Brek says: I see de fire in you, yes. Find more coals, more fire. Renew de livin' flame!\",\"timestamp\":1772323439,\"id\":\"s1_2869\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Did he just... hand you that fiery coal with his bare hands?\",\"timestamp\":1772323448,\"id\":\"s1_2870\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: I am glad to gain Halazzi's favor, but bein' here brings me shame.\",\"timestamp\":1772323459,\"id\":\"s1_2871\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Why? We rescued the Witherbark. You found the hash'ey shrines. And you are now closer to becoming hash'ey.\",\"timestamp\":1772323465,\"id\":\"s1_2872\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De Witherbark needed my help. And I did not listen. I was too worried about my own people.\",\"timestamp\":1772323474,\"id\":\"s1_2873\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Hèlio-Archimonde\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hèlio-Archimonde|h[|cffffffffHèlio-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61212:Player-1302-09C18F6E:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Magisters' Terrace]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772323476,\"id\":\"s1_2874\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Luckily, Halazzi could not help but meddle in Witherbark affairs despite what your grandfather had done.\",\"timestamp\":1772323481,\"id\":\"s1_2875\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Halazzi would not let them die. If it came to it, I feel Akil'zon would not have let us die as well.\",\"timestamp\":1772323488,\"id\":\"s1_2876\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: It sounds like your faith in the loa is strengthening.\",\"timestamp\":1772323496,\"id\":\"s1_2877\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Maybe. Akil'zon tested my conviction. And Halazzi forced me to use my head and not my fist.\",\"timestamp\":1772323500,\"id\":\"s1_2878\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: I only wish I had learned these lessons before and been a better leader.\",\"timestamp\":1772323508,\"id\":\"s1_2879\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: You had scant resources. I cannot say I would not have protected my home over others threatened with violence.\",\"timestamp\":1772323514,\"id\":\"s1_2880\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I have been in your situation. And like your grandfather, I wanted power and took it without caring who I hurt.\",\"timestamp\":1772323523,\"id\":\"s1_2881\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: I am proud to see you not making the mistakes that I or your grandfather made, and that I am part of your journey.\",\"timestamp\":1772323532,\"id\":\"s1_2882\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Proud? Of me? Hmph. I would like to say your words mean nothin'.\",\"timestamp\":1772323541,\"id\":\"s1_2883\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: But as you are one of my hash'ura, I... thank you for your words.\",\"timestamp\":1772323548,\"id\":\"s1_2884\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: He speaks madness but seems deeply attuned to de loa. Take de coal, Kvotheen, and see if we can start de trial.\",\"timestamp\":1772323558,\"id\":\"s1_2885\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323590,\"id\":\"s1_2886\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323601,\"id\":\"s1_2887\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323601,\"id\":\"s1_2888\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323609,\"id\":\"s1_2889\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772323609,\"id\":\"s1_2890\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Iranus-Ysondre\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Iranus-Ysondre|h[|cffa330c9Iranus-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-1335-0687D0A1:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772323625,\"id\":\"s1_2891\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323641,\"id\":\"s1_2892\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323641,\"id\":\"s1_2893\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260647::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Digested Human Hand]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772323682,\"id\":\"s1_2894\"},{\"reco