":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246621::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Venomous Horn]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324858,\"id\":\"s1_3025\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324858,\"id\":\"s1_3026\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324858,\"id\":\"s1_3027\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324865,\"id\":\"s1_3028\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246621::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Venomous Horn]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324865,\"id\":\"s1_3029\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Daki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Daki says: I think de venom is wearin' off. I was here and able to see and feel... but not speak or move!\",\"timestamp\":1772324925,\"id\":\"s1_3030\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halazzi\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halazzi says: It is safe to return to the village, if you feel ready.\",\"timestamp\":1772324932,\"id\":\"s1_3031\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: I could have died out there, old man.\",\"timestamp\":1772324940,\"id\":\"s1_3032\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Don't be so dramatic. You lived, eh?\",\"timestamp\":1772324943,\"id\":\"s1_3033\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Boy, assist Kvotheen. Chop de lumber.\",\"timestamp\":1772324975,\"id\":\"s1_3034\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: What? I'm still tied up! How am I supposed to help?\",\"timestamp\":1772324978,\"id\":\"s1_3035\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239138::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lightwood Chunk]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772324984,\"id\":\"s1_3036\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Sand it down now, child. No more complaints--stop distractin' Kvotheen.\",\"timestamp\":1772324985,\"id\":\"s1_3037\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Attach de blade, Kvotheen. Hold it steady for dem, boy.\",\"timestamp\":1772324991,\"id\":\"s1_3038\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: This would be easier if you would untie me.\",\"timestamp\":1772324994,\"id\":\"s1_3039\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Maybe. But it wouldn't be as funny. Stop whinin'.\",\"timestamp\":1772324998,\"id\":\"s1_3040\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Preserve de Light in de grain with de dragonhawk ash oil.\",\"timestamp\":1772324998,\"id\":\"s1_3041\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: Huh. Using a loa's magic to preserve the Light... Clever.\",\"timestamp\":1772325002,\"id\":\"s1_3042\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Eilyäa-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_YELL\",\"type\":\"YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Eilyäa-Hyjal:470:YELL:|h[|cffc69b6dEilyäa|r]|h yells: [Common] Nandige vohl garde\",\"timestamp\":1772325008,\"id\":\"s1_3043\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: I was a fool. You are just people--like us. It was the Twilight's Blade that attacked that night!\",\"timestamp\":1772325017,\"id\":\"s1_3044\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: But I must make this right. The Twilight's Blade will pay for my sister's death!\",\"timestamp\":1772325023,\"id\":\"s1_3045\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Wait! Come back, you reckless boy!\",\"timestamp\":1772325028,\"id\":\"s1_3046\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:241612::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lightwood Javelin]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325047,\"id\":\"s1_3047\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: Go. Eliminate de scout commander before he kills de boy.\",\"timestamp\":1772325048,\"id\":\"s1_3048\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Shrouder\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Twilight Shrouder says: What magic can cut through the Void?\",\"timestamp\":1772325073,\"id\":\"s1_3049\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Shrouder\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Twilight Shrouder says: Drown in the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1772325074,\"id\":\"s1_3050\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Twilight Shrouder\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Twilight Shrouder says: We will be saved...\",\"timestamp\":1772325087,\"id\":\"s1_3051\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 33 Silver, 48 Copper (+2 Silver, 66 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772325089,\"id\":\"s1_3052\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Covert Commander Tofir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Covert Commander Tofir says: The Light--it burns!\",\"timestamp\":1772325092,\"id\":\"s1_3053\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Covert Commander Tofir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Covert Commander Tofir says: Your light twigs are nothing against the Void!\",\"timestamp\":1772325092,\"id\":\"s1_3054\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Covert Commander Tofir\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Covert Commander Tofir says: The Void... will still find you...\",\"timestamp\":1772325099,\"id\":\"s1_3055\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: You... you came to my aid? I suppose the old woodcrafter sent you...\",\"timestamp\":1772325101,\"id\":\"s1_3056\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 12 Silver, 79 Copper (+4 Silver, 25 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772325101,\"id\":\"s1_3057\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: I... must go back and give him my thanks. I was wrong about so many things.\",\"timestamp\":1772325105,\"id\":\"s1_3058\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264449::::::::86:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:86:28:3086:::::|h[Lightwood Logging Hatchet]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325144,\"id\":\"s1_3059\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: I'm sorry. I know now I should not have made such a brash assumption.\",\"timestamp\":1772325144,\"id\":\"s1_3060\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kellor Sunshimmer says: Thank you for teaching me who the real enemy was. And to think before I act.\",\"timestamp\":1772325149,\"id\":\"s1_3061\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Woodcrafter Azai\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Woodcrafter Azai says: You're welcome, child. Now, go back to your farm. Zul'Aman's no place for an elf boy like you.\",\"timestamp\":1772325154,\"id\":\"s1_3062\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:258859::::::::86:263:::1:13611:2:9:86:28:3322:::::|h[Threadbare Mitts]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325221,\"id\":\"s1_3063\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:258138::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Potent Healing Potion]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325221,\"id\":\"s1_3064\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3376:0|h[Shard of Dundun]|h|rx1\",\"timestamp\":1772325222,\"id\":\"s1_3065\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vun'zarah\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vun'zarah says: Halazzi sent you?\",\"timestamp\":1772325261,\"id\":\"s1_3066\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Vun'zarah\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Vun'zarah says: Speak with Mixer Jamanga. He has a deep understanding of venoms from all over de Eastern Kingdoms.\",\"timestamp\":1772325264,\"id\":\"s1_3067\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Let us take a look...\",\"timestamp\":1772325285,\"id\":\"s1_3068\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Dis venom is from de local frogs, you say? I can make an anti-venom from de samples, but dis fang...\",\"timestamp\":1772325287,\"id\":\"s1_3069\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I know dis fang. It's de Shadra fang from Shadra'Alor! Dis worries me. How did de Vilebranch get it? It shoulda been safely hidden away.\",\"timestamp\":1772325293,\"id\":\"s1_3070\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Send any victims of dis venom to me--quickly now!\",\"timestamp\":1772325301,\"id\":\"s1_3071\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Daki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Daki says: I feel... better. Maybe? I'll go right now. It is good to have hope.\",\"timestamp\":1772325317,\"id\":\"s1_3072\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Kvotheen! Are they all right? What happened over at de shrine?\",\"timestamp\":1772325323,\"id\":\"s1_3073\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: They're all fleein' to de same place. Let's find out where dat is.\",\"timestamp\":1772325356,\"id\":\"s1_3074\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Why are dey not attackin' us? Dat's not what I was expectin'.\",\"timestamp\":1772325363,\"id\":\"s1_3075\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I know this looks bad, but listen to me first!\",\"timestamp\":1772325370,\"id\":\"s1_3076\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: The Vilebranch are attackin' de crypt and stealin' everythin'! Just let me explain...\",\"timestamp\":1772325377,\"id\":\"s1_3077\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: Talk fast, Shadra worshipper.\",\"timestamp\":1772325386,\"id\":\"s1_3078\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: You knew Shadra was here all along!\",\"timestamp\":1772325418,\"id\":\"s1_3079\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Yes, we brought two of her relics with us. We hoped she would return, but now de Vilebranch are tryin' to use her and her children against us.\",\"timestamp\":1772325420,\"id\":\"s1_3080\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I didn't even realize de fang was gone! I was too embarrassed to tell you when you showed it to me.\",\"timestamp\":1772325428,\"id\":\"s1_3081\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I rushed over here right away to check on de eye, and found de Vilebranch here!\",\"timestamp\":1772325434,\"id\":\"s1_3082\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Venomhexxer Iki\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Venomhexxer Iki says: You won't get Shadra back, fools.\",\"timestamp\":1772325457,\"id\":\"s1_3083\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325458,\"id\":\"s1_3084\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:246744::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Eye of Shadra]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325459,\"id\":\"s1_3085\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325465,\"id\":\"s1_3086\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I think de Vilebranch have realized dat Shadra can still be summoned and are tryin' to stop us--or even steal her away!\",\"timestamp\":1772325507,\"id\":\"s1_3087\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: The Vilebranch have been at fault all along, I agree. Let's talk with de loa.\",\"timestamp\":1772325515,\"id\":\"s1_3088\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: The loa is heedin' us!\",\"timestamp\":1772325520,\"id\":\"s1_3089\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: We have no altars, but it should still work. Place de fang first.\",\"timestamp\":1772325522,\"id\":\"s1_3090\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: But we need de eye as well. I hope it will be enough to reach her.\",\"timestamp\":1772325523,\"id\":\"s1_3091\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Shadra! Please, speak with us.\",\"timestamp\":1772325533,\"id\":\"s1_3092\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aspect of Shadra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aspect of Shadra says: Ah, my Witherbark. And a Revantusk. Most interesting.\",\"timestamp\":1772325536,\"id\":\"s1_3093\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aspect of Shadra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aspect of Shadra says: The loathesome Vilebranch are working against my children and my return.\",\"timestamp\":1772325540,\"id\":\"s1_3094\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Oh no--the ritual has failed. Shadra! We will find your shell!\",\"timestamp\":1772325541,\"id\":\"s1_3095\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Aspect of Shadra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Aspect of Shadra says: Recover my shell from the depths of Maisara, and we will punish the Vilebranch together.\",\"timestamp\":1772325545,\"id\":\"s1_3096\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: I will defend de crypt and relics here while you are away.\",\"timestamp\":1772325573,\"id\":\"s1_3097\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: Thank you, Nija. Nobody gonna take dem from de pair of us!\",\"timestamp\":1772325577,\"id\":\"s1_3098\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nija Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nija Torntusk says: A Witherbark and a Revantusk from de Hinterlands, together, for dis.\",\"timestamp\":1772325581,\"id\":\"s1_3099\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mixer Jamanga\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mixer Jamanga says: I left all dat in de Hinterlands. We're de same now--takin' back our land and our loa.\",\"timestamp\":1772325585,\"id\":\"s1_3100\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Prepare yourselves. Necromancy is a serious matter. We need to stop the Vilebranch.\",\"timestamp\":1772325592,\"id\":\"s1_3101\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Kvotheen. Oraka'zul! I am blessed ya be here to prowl with me.\",\"timestamp\":1772325594,\"id\":\"s1_3102\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Don't forget to buff up.\",\"timestamp\":1772325595,\"id\":\"s1_3103\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Mage table ready. Come and grab a bite for later.\",\"timestamp\":1772325598,\"id\":\"s1_3104\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I have used de shadows to see inside de cavern. I have seen my people--dead, alive, or... both.\",\"timestamp\":1772325599,\"id\":\"s1_3105\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Check your adventure guide if you need more information about what we'll find here.\",\"timestamp\":1772325599,\"id\":\"s1_3106\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: I fear they be sacrificed for some dark purpose. Come. I will guide you. We gonna rescue my people.\",\"timestamp\":1772325607,\"id\":\"s1_3107\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Frenzied Berserker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Frenzied Berserker yells: Intruders! Cut dem down!\",\"timestamp\":1772325609,\"id\":\"s1_3108\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325810,\"id\":\"s1_3109\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: What have they done... We have to help!\",\"timestamp\":1772325846,\"id\":\"s1_3110\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.6666666865348816,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crenna Earth-Daughter|h[Crenna Earth-Daughter]: |h|A:ping_chat_assist:0:0:0:0|aAssist\",\"timestamp\":1772325846,\"id\":\"s1_3111\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: Another Witherbark, another bag of coin for Muro'jin.\",\"timestamp\":1772325852,\"id\":\"s1_3112\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Dis favor won't be forgotten!\",\"timestamp\":1772325853,\"id\":\"s1_3113\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Spirits watch over ya, hero!\",\"timestamp\":1772325853,\"id\":\"s1_3114\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: He be de one bringin' my people here... Keep outta his way--for now.\",\"timestamp\":1772325858,\"id\":\"s1_3115\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325880,\"id\":\"s1_3116\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 5 Silver, 42 Copper (+2 Silver, 10 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772325881,\"id\":\"s1_3117\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: Who be stealin' my kill? Who be lettin' Halazzi's little kittens go?\",\"timestamp\":1772325929,\"id\":\"s1_3118\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Dis favor won't be forgotten!\",\"timestamp\":1772325929,\"id\":\"s1_3119\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Thanks! Time ta get outta here!\",\"timestamp\":1772325930,\"id\":\"s1_3120\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772325971,\"id\":\"s1_3121\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Dis favor won't be forgotten!\",\"timestamp\":1772325977,\"id\":\"s1_3122\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 70 Silver, 54 Copper (+1 Silver, 41 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772326007,\"id\":\"s1_3123\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: I owe ya one, friend!\",\"timestamp\":1772326051,\"id\":\"s1_3124\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Spirits watch over ya, hero!\",\"timestamp\":1772326052,\"id\":\"s1_3125\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772326076,\"id\":\"s1_3126\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772326162,\"id\":\"s1_3127\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Muro'jin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Muro'jin says: What does my eagle spy with her shiny eyes? A trespasser. An interloper! But ya won't take my prey from me!\",\"timestamp\":1772326198,\"id\":\"s1_3128\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Thanks! Time ta get outta here!\",\"timestamp\":1772326200,\"id\":\"s1_3129\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Witherbark Prisoner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Witherbark Prisoner says: Spirits watch over ya, hero!\",\"timestamp\":1772326200,\"id\":\"s1_3130\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260651::::::::86:263:::::::::|h[Lustrous Wildlife Pelt]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772326250,\"id\":\"s1_3131\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:16566:Player-1390-08FA49D3:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Great Shot!]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772326250,\"id\":\"s1_3132\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 81 Silver, 17 Copper (+3 Silver, 62 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772326251,\"id\":\"s1_3133\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Hitni-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hitni-Archimonde|h[|cff3fc7ebHitni-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62269:Player-1302-0C3B1C87:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: Amani Curious]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772326358,\"id\":\"s1_3134\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 12 Gold, 76 Copper (+24 Silver, 1 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772326413,\"id\":\"s1_3135\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: A good kill, Kvotheen. And I rescued all that were still alive. But why did Muro'jin bring them here?\",\"timestamp\":1772326414,\"id\":\"s1_3136\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: De kidnapping won't stop until we get to de root of de evil. Follow me.\",\"timestamp\":1772326421,\"id\":\"s1_3137\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: That... not be natural. And the energy flowing into it... This is hex magic.\",\"timestamp\":1772326435,\"id\":\"s1_3138\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Rokh'zal yells: You cannot stop de ritual! Spirits, rise!\",\"timestamp\":1772326442,\"id\":\"s1_3139\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: Using the souls of de dead in powerful magic spells... I hope this is not why they brought my kin here.\",\"timestamp\":1772326443,\"id\":\"s1_3140\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Rokh'zal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_RAID_BOSS_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_BOSS_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.8666667342185974,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|TInterface\\\\ICONS\\\\Spell_Shadow_RitualOfSacrifice.blp:20|t Rokh'zal prepares Captain Garrick for |cFFFF0000|Hspell:1259786|h[Ritual Sacrifice]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772326537,\"id\":\"s1_3141\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Kul'amara the Fierce says: It be worse than we thought. How many of my people have died here?\",\"timestamp\":1772326553,\"id\":\"s1_3142\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Get out of the way!\",\"timestamp\":1772326560,\"id\":\"s1_3143\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"e