ather this.\",\"id\":\"s1_3293\",\"timestamp\":1772357232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Austin Huxworth|h[Austin Huxworth]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s1_3294\",\"timestamp\":1772357232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 76 Silver, 27 Copper (+3 Silver, 52 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3295\",\"timestamp\":1772357232},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Preparin' will help you in de trial ahead.\",\"id\":\"s1_3296\",\"timestamp\":1772357236},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Austin Huxworth|h[Austin Huxworth]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s1_3297\",\"timestamp\":1772357236},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Austin Huxworth\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Austin Huxworth says: We should gather this.\",\"id\":\"s1_3298\",\"timestamp\":1772357236},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Preparin' will help you in de trial ahead.\",\"id\":\"s1_3299\",\"timestamp\":1772357241},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Let's gather these.\",\"id\":\"s1_3300\",\"timestamp\":1772357276},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crenna Earth-Daughter|h[Crenna Earth-Daughter]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s1_3301\",\"timestamp\":1772357276},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:245573::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Salmon]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3302\",\"timestamp\":1772357289},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Good. Resources will keep you alive.\",\"id\":\"s1_3303\",\"timestamp\":1772357289},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: In de winter there were those like de Hoardmonger whose greed burdened others.\",\"id\":\"s1_3304\",\"timestamp\":1772357296},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De Amani hash'ey used their most trusted warriors to eliminate them. For de good of de tribe.\",\"id\":\"s1_3305\",\"timestamp\":1772357303},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done. Like a living vine, some branches must be cut so de others may live. De tribe survives--for now.\",\"id\":\"s1_3306\",\"timestamp\":1772357426},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 12 Gold, 8 Silver, 75 Copper (+24 Silver, 17 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3307\",\"timestamp\":1772357427},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 59 Silver, 94 Copper (+3 Silver, 19 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3308\",\"timestamp\":1772357489},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Aramasu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Aramasu-Hyjal:165:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Aramasu|r]|h: lol jai pas encors fini la 1er zone ^^\",\"id\":\"s1_3309\",\"timestamp\":1772357506},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"name\":\"Blackløtus-KirinTor\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Blackløtus-KirinTor:168:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aBlackløtus|r]|h: Heuuu....les initiatives sont pas réinitialisé pour moi \",\"id\":\"s1_3310\",\"timestamp\":1772357542},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260620::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Stone Droppings]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3311\",\"timestamp\":1772357614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260614::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Unrecognizable Organ]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3312\",\"timestamp\":1772357614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3313\",\"timestamp\":1772357614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Seasons in de loa's mind are changin'. All you can do is take shelter from de rising winds.\",\"id\":\"s1_3314\",\"timestamp\":1772357631},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Meredy Huntswell|h[Meredy Huntswell]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s1_3315\",\"timestamp\":1772357671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Austin Huxworth\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Austin Huxworth says: Find shelter!\",\"id\":\"s1_3316\",\"timestamp\":1772357671},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Austin Huxworth|h[Austin Huxworth]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s1_3317\",\"timestamp\":1772357721},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: Find shelter!\",\"id\":\"s1_3318\",\"timestamp\":1772357721},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Meredy Huntswell|h[Meredy Huntswell]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s1_3319\",\"timestamp\":1772357771},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: Take cover!\",\"id\":\"s1_3320\",\"timestamp\":1772357771},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crenna Earth-Daughter|h[Crenna Earth-Daughter]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s1_3321\",\"timestamp\":1772357821},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Meredy Huntswell\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Meredy Huntswell says: We must find shelter from the winds!\",\"id\":\"s1_3322\",\"timestamp\":1772357821},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Disyxoine-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Disyxoine-KhazModan|h[|cff00ff98Disyxoine-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61641:Player-3690-0BA7BEA3:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Blinding Vale]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3323\",\"timestamp\":1772357859},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Austin Huxworth|h[Austin Huxworth]: |h|A:ping_chat_onmyway:0:0:0:0|aOn my way\",\"id\":\"s1_3324\",\"timestamp\":1772357871},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Take cover!\",\"id\":\"s1_3325\",\"timestamp\":1772357871},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: De winter do not care who you are. Hash'ey, elder, child, beggar. It tests all.\",\"id\":\"s1_3326\",\"timestamp\":1772357902},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: This should call upon the Sentinel of Winter.\",\"id\":\"s1_3327\",\"timestamp\":1772357906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Crenna Earth-Daughter|h[Crenna Earth-Daughter]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s1_3328\",\"timestamp\":1772357906},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Impressive. You have proved your strength and endurance. But what about your loyalty?\",\"id\":\"s1_3329\",\"timestamp\":1772358027},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 11 Gold, 59 Silver, 23 Copper (+23 Silver, 18 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3330\",\"timestamp\":1772358028},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Come back to de fire. Your last trial awaits you.\",\"id\":\"s1_3331\",\"timestamp\":1772358035},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_PING\",\"type\":\"PING\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0.6666666865348816},\"text\":\"[Tank] |Hplayer:Captain Garrick|h[Captain Garrick]: |h|A:ping_chat_nonthreat:0:0:0:0|aLook here\",\"id\":\"s1_3332\",\"timestamp\":1772358037},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: On your mark.\",\"id\":\"s1_3333\",\"timestamp\":1772358037},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: I'll keep you safe. Follow me.\",\"id\":\"s1_3334\",\"timestamp\":1772358050},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruthless Totemcaller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruthless Totemcaller yells: We got some worthy challengers to face de Loa of War, now. Good luck, hash'ura!\",\"id\":\"s1_3335\",\"timestamp\":1772358062},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 30 Silver, 11 Copper (+2 Silver, 60 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3336\",\"timestamp\":1772358087},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dordok-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dordok-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Dordok-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61455:Player-1335-06882EAF:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Shadowpine Scattered]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3337\",\"timestamp\":1772358099},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3338\",\"timestamp\":1772358133},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"class\":\"DEATHKNIGHT\",\"name\":\"Seizublood-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizublood-Hyjal:254:GUILD:|h[|cffc41e3aSeizublood|r]|h: encore 1j\",\"id\":\"s1_3339\",\"timestamp\":1772358162},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: Very well. You take point.\",\"id\":\"s1_3340\",\"timestamp\":1772358209},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: I'll keep you safe. Follow me.\",\"id\":\"s1_3341\",\"timestamp\":1772358213},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Captain Garrick\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Captain Garrick says: Very well. You take point.\",\"id\":\"s1_3342\",\"timestamp\":1772358226},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3343\",\"timestamp\":1772358251},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 98 Silver, 48 Copper (+3 Silver, 96 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3344\",\"timestamp\":1772358252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"name\":\"Grodar-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Grodar-Archimonde|h[|cffc69b6dGrodar-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61960:Player-1302-0C8AD4A9:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Treasures of Eversong Woods]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3345\",\"timestamp\":1772358253},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: What took you so long, eh? De loa will not fight me without you.\",\"id\":\"s1_3346\",\"timestamp\":1772358337},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Hold. Before ya face de loa, ya must face an' kill... me.\",\"id\":\"s1_3347\",\"timestamp\":1772358341},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Leadership requires sacrifice. Even of the things we cherish.\",\"id\":\"s1_3348\",\"timestamp\":1772358348},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Nanea says: Well done, Amani cub. You have... passed de trial. Take de Burden of Nalorakk.\",\"id\":\"s1_3349\",\"timestamp\":1772358383},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: She has died honorably. But the death of those loyal to me... that is my burden. It will be yours as hash'ey.\",\"id\":\"s1_3350\",\"timestamp\":1772358398},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Dwalgo-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Dwalgo-Hyjal:281:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Dwalgo|r]|h: re!\",\"id\":\"s1_3351\",\"timestamp\":1772358399},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s1_3352\",\"timestamp\":1772358503},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61638:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Den of Nalorakk]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s1_3353\",\"timestamp\":1772358503},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Well done. Your strength rivals mine. The dream... ends.\",\"id\":\"s1_3354\",\"timestamp\":1772358503},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:264332::::::::87:263::17::1:28:3906:::::|h[Amani Ritual Altar]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3355\",\"timestamp\":1772358512},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 25 Gold, 65 Silver, 49 Copper\",\"id\":\"s1_3356\",\"timestamp\":1772358513},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Crenna Earth-Daughter says: Good job everyone. We're done here now. You can leave anytime.\",\"id\":\"s1_3357\",\"timestamp\":1772358524},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:251155::::::::87:263::17:3:13441:13436:13578:2:9:87:28:3086:::::|h[Tribal Defender's Cord]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772379848,\"id\":\"s1_3358\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Now dat I have Nalorakk's blessing--and Burden--we can rally my people and end Mor'duun for good!\",\"timestamp\":1772379864,\"id\":\"s1_3359\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Pel'na Torntusk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Pel'na Torntusk says: Kvotheen, have you seen any furbolg lurkin' 'round here?\",\"timestamp\":1772379885,\"id\":\"s1_3360\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lilaju\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lilaju says: We shouldn't assume dey wanted to attack us, Pel'na. Dey looked like dey wanted help.\",\"timestamp\":1772379896,\"id\":\"s1_3361\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61581:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Zul'Aman Glyph Hunter]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772379924,\"id\":\"s1_3362\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61581:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Zul'Aman Glyph Hunter]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772379924,\"id\":\"s1_3363\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Loa Speaker Kinduru says: Zul'jarra! Your brother refused to wait. He took de warriors and he's gonna get dem killed!\",\"timestamp\":1772380000,\"id\":\"s1_3364\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra yells: With de blessin' of de loa, we will rid Zul'Aman of de Twilight's Blade. For de Amani!\",\"timestamp\":1772380113,\"id\":\"s1_3365\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_TEXT_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"You blow a kiss to Princess Zambina.\",\"timestamp\":1772380155,\"id\":\"s1_3366\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Vengeance for Atal'Aman! Remind these invaders dis land is ours!\",\"timestamp\":1772380162,\"id\":\"s1_3367\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: Amani reinforcements? No matter. More chaos and death to please Xal'atath!\",\"timestamp\":1772380169,\"id\":\"s1_3368\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: De loa have given me power. But still, de thrill of battle is what fills my heart!\",\"timestamp\":1772380217,\"id\":\"s1_3369\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Back in de fight!\",\"timestamp\":1772380223,\"id\":\"s1_3370\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Spoken like a typical Amani. But... I would be lying to say I don't feel the same.\",\"timestamp\":1772380225,\"id\":\"s1_3371\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Then let's see which of us feels de thrill more, elf!\",\"timestamp\":1772380236,\"id\":\"s1_3372\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 52 Silver, 94 Copper (+5 Silver, 5 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772380239,\"id\":\"s1_3373\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra yells: FOR DE AMANI!\",\"timestamp\":1772380242,\"id\":\"s1_3374\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin yells: FOR THE LIGHT!\",\"timestamp\":1772380242,\"id\":\"s1_3375\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Back in de fight!\",\"timestamp\":1772380259,\"id\":\"s1_3376\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Nalorakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Nalorakk says: Finally joining the battle? Show our foes what you learned from me!\",\"timestamp\":1772380261,\"id\":\"s1_3377\"},{\"r