\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: I shouldn't have followed Zul'jan here!\",\"timestamp\":1772380536,\"id\":\"s1_3419\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 58 Silver, 71 Copper (+3 Silver, 17 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772380545,\"id\":\"s1_3420\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Thank ya. I thought I was a goner!\",\"timestamp\":1772380547,\"id\":\"s1_3421\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: Your struggle is... entertaining. But you will die for the glory of Xal'atath!\",\"timestamp\":1772380550,\"id\":\"s1_3422\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Injured Amani Warrior\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Injured Amani Warrior says: Back in de fight!\",\"timestamp\":1772380552,\"id\":\"s1_3423\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: Bah! My minions are nothing more than fodder! Slay as many as you wish!\",\"timestamp\":1772380563,\"id\":\"s1_3424\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 32 Silver, 57 Copper (+6 Silver, 65 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772380564,\"id\":\"s1_3425\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: We couldn't wait any longer for your loa. If my hand forced yours, so be it!\",\"timestamp\":1772380568,\"id\":\"s1_3426\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:248581::::::::87:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:87:28:3086:::::|h[Atalguard's Oath Shoulderguards]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772380581,\"id\":\"s1_3427\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: We need to take de fight to Mor'duun. Let's go.\",\"timestamp\":1772380728,\"id\":\"s1_3428\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: You seek to challenge me? Hah! Your strength isn't even enough to break my barrier!\",\"timestamp\":1772380734,\"id\":\"s1_3429\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akil'zon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Akil'zon says: Mor'duun thinks he is safe behind his barrier. He is wrong.\",\"timestamp\":1772380744,\"id\":\"s1_3430\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: Great Loa. You helped us get this far. But it must be us dat end this fight for good.\",\"timestamp\":1772380761,\"id\":\"s1_3431\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akil'zon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Akil'zon says: Very well. We will remove Mor'duun's void barrier.\",\"timestamp\":1772380769,\"id\":\"s1_3432\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Akil'zon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Akil'zon says: Go forth, Zul'jarra. Take our blessing and crush your prey!\",\"timestamp\":1772380780,\"id\":\"s1_3433\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: I will not die by your hand, mortals. Only a god could slay me!\",\"timestamp\":1772380808,\"id\":\"s1_3434\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: How about a mortal blessed by four of dem?\",\"timestamp\":1772380819,\"id\":\"s1_3435\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:168:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: si je me fais ban sachez que se sera encore en pechant\",\"timestamp\":1772380825,\"id\":\"s1_3436\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Mor'duun\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Mor'duun says: I will bring your corpses to Xal'atath personally!\",\"timestamp\":1772380839,\"id\":\"s1_3437\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Not if my blade sends her yours first!\",\"timestamp\":1772380846,\"id\":\"s1_3438\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:248583::::::::87:263::11:3:13183:13613:6652:2:9:87:28:3086:::::|h[Drum of Renewed Bonds]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772380895,\"id\":\"s1_3439\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: The end. Finally.\",\"timestamp\":1772380925,\"id\":\"s1_3440\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: The battlefield is quiet. Your warriors must have finished off the remaining Twilight's Blade.\",\"timestamp\":1772380930,\"id\":\"s1_3441\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Lightwood. Loa. Outsiders... Even combined, an ocean of Amani blood paid for our victory.\",\"timestamp\":1772380938,\"id\":\"s1_3442\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: We will mourn their loss. But now we should celebrate what dey have given us.\",\"timestamp\":1772380956,\"id\":\"s1_3443\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Herbalism has increased to 53.\",\"timestamp\":1772381020,\"id\":\"s1_3444\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236770::::::::87:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Sanguithorn |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772381020,\"id\":\"s1_3445\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 77 Silver, 43 Copper (+3 Silver, 54 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772381029,\"id\":\"s1_3446\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61957:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Sojourner of Eversong Woods]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772381071,\"id\":\"s1_3447\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:190:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: a priori y'a un nouveau tome de domptage\",\"timestamp\":1772381077,\"id\":\"s1_3448\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:255648::::::::87:263::11::1:28:3086:::::|h[Zul'Aman Ancestral Fountain]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772381155,\"id\":\"s1_3449\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:200:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: suis maudit de la peche\",\"timestamp\":1772381169,\"id\":\"s1_3450\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:201:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: jpp\",\"timestamp\":1772381170,\"id\":\"s1_3451\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:202:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: mdr\",\"timestamp\":1772381174,\"id\":\"s1_3452\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: You have my thanks, Kvotheen. Gokinye or no, de Amani will greet you with honor in our lands.\",\"timestamp\":1772381185,\"id\":\"s1_3453\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:205:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: tout le jeu a crash acces violation memory\",\"timestamp\":1772381186,\"id\":\"s1_3454\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:206:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: jpp\",\"timestamp\":1772381187,\"id\":\"s1_3455\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"Gnome\",\"name\":\"Easyness-LesSentinelles\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Easyness-LesSentinelles|h[|cfffff468Easyness-LesSentinelles|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:153:Player-1127-0B334817:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Old Gnome and the Sea]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772381192,\"id\":\"s1_3456\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jarra\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jarra says: And if you find Zul'jan... remind him dat he and I are always blood, no matter what.\",\"timestamp\":1772381195,\"id\":\"s1_3457\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ1:|Hcurrency:3316:0|h[Voidlight Marl]|h|rx500\",\"timestamp\":1772381211,\"id\":\"s1_3458\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:267642::::::::87:263::25:2:13649:13668:1:28:3086:::::|h[Worn Amani Heartstring Pendant]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772381221,\"id\":\"s1_3459\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Dwarf\",\"name\":\"Dwalgo-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Dwalgo-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Dwalgo|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62289:Player-1390-088F9757:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Zul'Aman: The Highest Peaks]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772381250,\"id\":\"s1_3460\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: We were young when our mother died. My sister held de tribes together with de force of her will--without de loa.\",\"timestamp\":1772381309,\"id\":\"s1_3461\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: I could never be de warrior that Zul'jarra is. I talk my way through problems. She plows through them head on.\",\"timestamp\":1772381320,\"id\":\"s1_3462\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: We have different goals for de Amani. Zul'jarra focuses on growing and preserving de Amani tribes within Zul'Aman.\",\"timestamp\":1772381330,\"id\":\"s1_3463\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: I see de strength of the Amani--our tribe. We should conquer those around us! Zul'jarra doesn't understand.\",\"timestamp\":1772381341,\"id\":\"s1_3464\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: When Mor'duun came, I saw my vision of de Amani coming to life. With de lightwood, we would conquer de Twilight's Blade and then Eversong.\",\"timestamp\":1772381352,\"id\":\"s1_3465\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: Zul'jarra could not see my vision, but I saw no other way. De loa? Feh.\",\"timestamp\":1772381363,\"id\":\"s1_3466\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: De loa say our grandfather, de great Zul'jin, betrayed them. But why believe them? Or my dotterin' uncle. Or any gokinye?\",\"timestamp\":1772381370,\"id\":\"s1_3467\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: They abandoned us. They. Abandoned. Us. How do we know they won't do it again?\",\"timestamp\":1772381383,\"id\":\"s1_3468\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: I see your eyes are widening, \\\"hash'ura.\\\" You're right. Forget what I have said. We have won. Zul'jarra has won.\",\"timestamp\":1772381391,\"id\":\"s1_3469\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zul'jan\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Zul'jan says: I will go back to de village and celebrate with my sister.\",\"timestamp\":1772381404,\"id\":\"s1_3470\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772381453,\"id\":\"s1_3471\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41803:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[For Zul'Aman!]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772381453,\"id\":\"s1_3472\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: Let us make haste for the Sanctum of Light.\",\"timestamp\":1772381487,\"id\":\"s1_3473\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lady Liadrin\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lady Liadrin says: This report may evoke... skepticism in Lor'themar. Best you're with me when he hears it.\",\"timestamp\":1772381491,\"id\":\"s1_3474\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256928::::::::87:263::11::1:28:3086:::::|h[Banner of the Amani Tribe]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772381569,\"id\":\"s1_3475\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Archmage Aethas Sunreaver says: We need to put a stop to these fights.\",\"timestamp\":1772381586,\"id\":\"s1_3476\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Koruth Mountainfist says: Agreed. This city's a powder keg ready to go.\",\"timestamp\":1772381589,\"id\":\"s1_3477\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: You let the Alliance into our city? They killed so many of us!\",\"timestamp\":1772381596,\"id\":\"s1_3478\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: We can't defend against both the Voidstorm and the aggression from the Lightbloom.\",\"timestamp\":1772381631,\"id\":\"s1_3479\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Halduron has joined your haranir friend to aid in ending the threat. They await you in Fairbreeze.\",\"timestamp\":1772381636,\"id\":\"s1_3480\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: You let the Alliance into our city? They killed so many of us!\",\"timestamp\":1772381644,\"id\":\"s1_3481\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Tehd Shoemaker\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Tehd Shoemaker yells: I'm a Warlock, not a cultist.\",\"timestamp\":1772381660,\"id\":\"s1_3482\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Commander Venel Lightblood says: Release the Void-wielders. They may wander the city, but we will tolerate none of their taint near the Sunwell.\",\"timestamp\":1772381680,\"id\":\"s1_3483\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard is making the Sunwell scream! Can you not feel it?!\",\"timestamp\":1772381689,\"id\":\"s1_3484\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard will abandon us! They care nothing for the Sunwell!\",\"timestamp\":1772381697,\"id\":\"s1_3485\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard is making the Sunwell scream! Can you not feel it?!\",\"timestamp\":1772381704,\"id\":\"s1_3486\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: The Vanguard is making the Sunwell scream! Can you not feel it?!\",\"timestamp\":1772381716,\"id\":\"s1_3487\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: So be it.\",\"timestamp\":1772381718,\"id\":\"s1_3488\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:263871::::::::87:263::11::1:28:373:::::|h[Holy Pet Leash]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772381729,\"id\":\"s1_3489\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Your hope is a weakness!\",\"timestamp\":1772381744,\"id\":\"s1_3490\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Gold, 27 Silver, 50 Copper (+4 Silver, 55 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772381767,\"id\":\"s1_3491\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: So be it.\",\"timestamp\":1772381774,\"id\":\"s1_3492\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Doomsayer yells: Only the most vicious shall survive the Void!\",\"timestamp\":1772381793,\"id\":\"s1_3493\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You loot 3 Gold, 41 Silver, 62 Copper (+6 Silver, 83 Copper)\",\"timestamp\":1772381804,\"id\":\"s1_3494\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Camberon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Camberon says: I'm far too busy to keep up with your training, but you're welcome to use my cauldron over there.\",\"timestamp\":1772381808,\"id\":\"s1_3495\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hallowfall Aeroknight\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Hallowfall Aeroknight says: This is for the Sunwell. We cannot survive on just mana biscuits.\",\"timestamp\":1772381813,\"id\":\"s1_3496\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sin'dorei Fruit Vendor\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sin'dorei Fruit Vendor says: You already took our Magister, our knights, our weapons, and now our food?\",\"timestamp\":1772381817,\"id\":\"s1_3497\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61648:Player-1390-08FA49D3:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: The Blinding Vale]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772381838,\"id\":\"s1_3498\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:4476:Player-1390-08FA49D3:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Looking For More]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772381838,\"id\":\"s1_3499\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: You... you might be right. Thank you, champion.\",\"timestamp\":1772381847,\"id\":\"s1_3500\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doomsayer\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Doomsayer says: I... concede your point.\",\"timestamp\":1772381854,\"id\":\"s1_3501\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Who rules Silvermoon? Is it Lor'themar? Or the fake King of Stormwind?\",\"timestamp\":1772381863,\"id\":\"s1_3502\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I have to learn more of the Lightbloom, even with the risks of traveling to your homeland.\",\"timestamp\":1772381932,\"id\":\"s1_3503\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Harandar is a dangerous place.\",\"timestamp\":1772381982,\"id\":\"s1_3504\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: I warn you both: my people do not welcome outsiders. They may no longer welcome me.\",\"timestamp\":1772381986,\"id\":\"s1_3505\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: This place... It is like we've stepped back in time.\",\"timestamp\":1772382021,\"id\":\"s1_3506\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Tread carefully. You will be seen as invaders.\",\"timestamp\":1772382026,\"id\":\"s1_3507\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The people of the Har'athir settlement tend these roots. It is a short way down the path.\",\"timestamp\":1772382105,\"id\":\"s1_3508\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I see why they are so protective... Such untouched beauty.\",\"timestamp\":1772382112,\"id\":\"s1_3509\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Orweyna? Who are these--what have you done?\",\"timestamp\":1772382117,\"id\":\"s1_3510\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: That doesn't matter now. You need help.\",\"timestamp\":1772382165,\"id\":\"s1_3511\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Two of our young are still out here!\",\"timestamp\":1772382169,\"id\":\"s1_3512\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Kvotheen will find them. We must get you to safety.\",\"timestamp\":1772382173,\"id\":\"s1_3513\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Oorla\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Oorla says: Who--what are you? Stay back, I'm warning you!\",\"timestamp\":1772382191,\"id\":\"s1_3514\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Oorla\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Oorla says: Fine, but those were my kills! No taking credit.\",\"timestamp\":1772382200,\"id\":\"s1_3515\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:236761::::::::87:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Tranquility Bloom |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772382209,\"id\":\"s1_3516\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danul says: Aln'hara's roots! Who are you?\",\"timestamp\":1772382217,\"id\":\"s1_3517\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Aramasu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aramasu-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Aramasu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61856:Player-1390-0D58EB43:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Explore Zul'Aman]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772382218,\"id\":\"s1_3518\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal:424:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h: YOOO\",\"timestamp\":1772382218,\"id\":\"s1_3519\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Danul\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Danul says: Aw, I was just getting warmed up too.\",\"timestamp\":1772382223,\"id\":\"s1_3520\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772382231,\"id\":\"s1_3521\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242640::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Plant Protein]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772382231,\"id\":\"s1_3522\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Incredible. Kvotheen, come and see.\",\"timestamp\":1772382238,\"id\":\"s1_3523\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Behold, Harandar.\",\"timestamp\":1772382242,\"id\":\"s1_3524\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: This way, Halduron, Kvotheen.\",\"timestamp\":1772382325,\"id\":\"s1_3525\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Har'athir Dweller\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Har'athir Dweller says: An outsider! Here?\",\"timestamp\":1772382341,\"id\":\"s1_3526\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ruia says: This so-called \\\"Lightbloom\\\" is no real threat. It does not excuse your heresies.\",\"timestamp\":1772382347,\"id\":\"s1_3527\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256227::::::::87:263::11:2: