:1772384166,\"id\":\"s1_3553\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Khennaï-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Khennaï-Hyjal:490:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKhennaï|r]|h: Midnight n'est officiellment pas sorti\",\"timestamp\":1772384167,\"id\":\"s1_3554\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"name\":\"Khennaï-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Khennaï-Hyjal:491:GUILD:|h[|cff0070ddKhennaï|r]|h: C'est comme pour les gouffre si Valeera ne fait pas tout c'est que pour l'instant ça reste bran le sujet de gouffre\",\"timestamp\":1772384187,\"id\":\"s1_3555\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal:492:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h: poue le bas peuple c'est pas sorti XD\",\"timestamp\":1772384193,\"id\":\"s1_3556\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruia says: Go to the Den at once! The Council will decide your fates.\",\"id\":\"s1_3557\",\"timestamp\":1772384953},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: My skin is tingling. What IS this?\",\"id\":\"s1_3558\",\"timestamp\":1772384978},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Alndust--remnants of the goddess's will, given form. It empowers our magics and allows us to walk between worlds.\",\"id\":\"s1_3559\",\"timestamp\":1772384983},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Orweyna has gone ahead to speak to her elders. Let me know when you're ready, Kvotheen.\",\"id\":\"s1_3560\",\"timestamp\":1772385030},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Cïarrah-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cïarrah-KhazModan|h[|cfff48cbaCïarrah-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61419:Player-3690-08F60A13:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Brawler's Chilled]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3561\",\"timestamp\":1772385097},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:256201::::::::87:263::11:4:13573:13613:13615:6652:2:9:87:28:3087:::::|h[Unwelcome Visitor's Sash]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3562\",\"timestamp\":1772385172},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruia says: You have forgotten the value of tradition, Orweyna. Go to the Den of Echoes, and remind yourself of what it means to be haranir.\",\"id\":\"s1_3563\",\"timestamp\":1772385172},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62202:Player-1390-0C65DBA2:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Spiritpaw Marathon]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3564\",\"timestamp\":1772385189},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: The elders have spoken. They hope that reliving the past will show you the folly of your actions.\",\"id\":\"s1_3565\",\"timestamp\":1772385193},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Seizuko-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Seizuko-Hyjal:528:GUILD:|h[|cffaad372Seizuko|r]|h: aider un bébé capibara c'est la vie que j'ai choisi\",\"id\":\"s1_3566\",\"timestamp\":1772385240},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Milkywait\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Boon of Alacrity has been acquired by Milkywait-Hyjal! Movement Speed has been permanently increased for all!\",\"id\":\"s1_3567\",\"timestamp\":1772385270},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Cïarrah-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cïarrah-KhazModan|h[|cfff48cbaCïarrah-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61423:Player-3690-08F60A13:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Featherweight Brawler]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3568\",\"timestamp\":1772385338},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236770::::::::87:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Sanguithorn |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3569\",\"timestamp\":1772385386},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: I understand the threat of the Lightbloom, but we need to appease the elders or you will have two enemies in Harandar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3570\",\"timestamp\":1772385391},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Aln'hara guide you. Good luck.\",\"id\":\"s1_3571\",\"timestamp\":1772385473},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: It is not like you to avoid conflict.\",\"id\":\"s1_3572\",\"timestamp\":1772385476},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Have your fangs dulled since I was gone?\",\"id\":\"s1_3573\",\"timestamp\":1772385479},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Don't test me, little sprout. I know when to roar and when to wait.\",\"id\":\"s1_3574\",\"timestamp\":1772385481},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: I could have pitted my pride against Ruia, but alone what good would it do?\",\"id\":\"s1_3575\",\"timestamp\":1772385487},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: You are as strong as any.\",\"id\":\"s1_3576\",\"timestamp\":1772385494},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: First you left, then the roots of Teldrassil burned. Now the elders barely consider me one of them.\",\"id\":\"s1_3577\",\"timestamp\":1772385497},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Should I not have heeded the goddess's call?\",\"id\":\"s1_3578\",\"timestamp\":1772385507},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: You did what needed to be done. I have always told you to trust your instincts.\",\"id\":\"s1_3579\",\"timestamp\":1772385510},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: All I ask is that you trust mine. We must regain their faith in you.\",\"id\":\"s1_3580\",\"timestamp\":1772385516},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: And know that I will always defend you, even if you do not see.\",\"id\":\"s1_3581\",\"timestamp\":1772385522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: I was told you would be arriving, Kvotheen. Let us begin.\",\"id\":\"s1_3582\",\"timestamp\":1772385555},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Touch the painting. The Alndust within empowers it to reveal our truths.\",\"id\":\"s1_3583\",\"timestamp\":1772385564},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Countless generations ago our people walked beneath the trees of the great mountain.\",\"id\":\"s1_3584\",\"timestamp\":1772385566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: None knew of our presence. Not the giant whose steps shook the earth... nor her massive beasts.\",\"id\":\"s1_3585\",\"timestamp\":1772385572},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3586\",\"timestamp\":1772385594},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3587\",\"timestamp\":1772385607},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61641:Player-1390-0CD41AF9:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[The Blinding Vale]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3588\",\"timestamp\":1772385610},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3589\",\"timestamp\":1772385619},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3590\",\"timestamp\":1772385626},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3591\",\"timestamp\":1772385639},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:239014::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Iceberries]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3592\",\"timestamp\":1772385647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Draenei\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Cïarrah-KhazModan\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Cïarrah-KhazModan|h[|cfff48cbaCïarrah-KhazModan|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61421:Player-3690-08F60A13:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Prime Ordeal]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3593\",\"timestamp\":1772385649},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Hiding was not our only talent.\",\"id\":\"s1_3594\",\"timestamp\":1772385659},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:246415::::::::87:263::11::1:28:3087:::::|h[Ruddy Haranir Pigment Bowl]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3595\",\"timestamp\":1772385669},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: We learned the shape of the beasts.\",\"id\":\"s1_3596\",\"timestamp\":1772385684},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: We grew to become the forest's greatest hunters.\",\"id\":\"s1_3597\",\"timestamp\":1772385688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Rivaling, and then taming the fiercest predators.\",\"id\":\"s1_3598\",\"timestamp\":1772385693},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3599\",\"timestamp\":1772385723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260652::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Broken Wildlife Claw]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3600\",\"timestamp\":1772385723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3601\",\"timestamp\":1772385723},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260656::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Perforated Wing]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3602\",\"timestamp\":1772385736},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3603\",\"timestamp\":1772385743},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3604\",\"timestamp\":1772385743},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260665::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Sizable Tusk]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3605\",\"timestamp\":1772385752},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:242639::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Practically Pork]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3606\",\"timestamp\":1772385752},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260656::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Perforated Wing]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3607\",\"timestamp\":1772385782},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: In times of quiet, we felt empty. We longed for purpose.\",\"id\":\"s1_3608\",\"timestamp\":1772385803},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:258960::::::::87:263::133:1:13729:2:9:87:28:3087:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Beacon]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3609\",\"timestamp\":1772385804},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260656::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Perforated Wing]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3610\",\"timestamp\":1772385804},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Our longing was answered by a song from the depths of the world.\",\"id\":\"s1_3611\",\"timestamp\":1772385863},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: Not all heeded the goddess's call, but the Hara'ti followed the Song.\",\"id\":\"s1_3612\",\"timestamp\":1772385867},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Observer Talos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Observer Talos says: Directive -- Highfather denies all access.\",\"id\":\"s1_3613\",\"timestamp\":1772385872},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: The journey was long and very difficult. We faced many hardships on the way.\",\"id\":\"s1_3614\",\"timestamp\":1772385874},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Observer Talos\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Observer Talos says: System... failure.\",\"id\":\"s1_3615\",\"timestamp\":1772385883},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 1 Gold, 9 Silver, 8 Copper (+2 Silver, 18 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3616\",\"timestamp\":1772385885},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: We battled our way through the roots, and found ourselves in Harandar. But that is a deeper, more dangerous tale.\",\"id\":\"s1_3617\",\"timestamp\":1772385889},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256191::::::::87:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:87:28:3087:::::|h[Handaxe of Painted Memories]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3618\",\"timestamp\":1772385898},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Zur'ashar Kassameh says: One trial yet remains. Hagar is waiting for you ahead. May Aln'hara be with you, Kvotheen.\",\"id\":\"s1_3619\",\"timestamp\":1772385913},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: These paintings... I've never experienced a magic like this.\",\"id\":\"s1_3620\",\"timestamp\":1772385927},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: It is made possible by the Alndust. One of the many reasons it is so sacred to us.\",\"id\":\"s1_3621\",\"timestamp\":1772385934},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: The final mural holds our most sacred memory -- and our most ancient shame. To witness it, you will need a fragment we store away from the rest.\",\"id\":\"s1_3622\",\"timestamp\":1772385943},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar begins making a campfire.\",\"id\":\"s1_3623\",\"timestamp\":1772385945},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: One moment.\",\"id\":\"s1_3624\",\"timestamp\":1772385953},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Your life is mine.\",\"id\":\"s1_3625\",\"timestamp\":1772385994},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Kobold Mystic\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Kobold Mystic attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s1_3626\",\"timestamp\":1772385998},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Spitfire Fusetender\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Spitfire Fusetender attempts to run away in fear!\",\"id\":\"s1_3627\",\"timestamp\":1772386001},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: Now strike!\",\"id\":\"s1_3628\",\"timestamp\":1772386001},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONEY\",\"type\":\"MONEY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You loot 2 Silver, 76 Copper (+5 Copper)\",\"id\":\"s1_3629\",\"timestamp\":1772386007},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:263516::::::::87:263:::::::::|h[Cosmic Ritual Bowl]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3630\",\"timestamp\":1772386031},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: Our ancestors traveled for weeks, finding strange peoples deep below Mount Hyjal. They thought the haranir were strange too.\",\"id\":\"s1_3631\",\"timestamp\":1772386039},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Valeera Sanguinar says: I'll take that.\",\"id\":\"s1_3632\",\"timestamp\":1772386063},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Valeera Sanguinar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG