says: This seed... It's coated in--\",\"id\":\"s1_3762\",\"timestamp\":1772387684},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Alndust. Perhaps that is what shielded Eonka from the Lightbloom.\",\"id\":\"s1_3763\",\"timestamp\":1772387688},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Hagar says: The elders control the Alndust supply. I doubt they will be keen to share it with outsiders.\",\"id\":\"s1_3764\",\"timestamp\":1772387693},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Alndust... The elders will not part with it easily. Still, we have to try.\",\"id\":\"s1_3765\",\"timestamp\":1772387719},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61734:Player-1390-0CD41AF9:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Endgame]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3766\",\"timestamp\":1772387734},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42328:Player-1390-0CD41AF9:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Warband Mentor: Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3767\",\"timestamp\":1772387734},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:938:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: OULALA\",\"id\":\"s1_3768\",\"timestamp\":1772387787},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:939:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:264598::::::::90:268::25:3:12769:6652:13668:1:28:3321:::::|h[Chevalière en anguillectrum]|h|r Gigabis !\",\"id\":\"s1_3769\",\"timestamp\":1772387792},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"PRIEST\",\"name\":\"Jamelmoignon-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Jamelmoignon-Hyjal:940:GUILD:|h[|cffffffffJamelmoignon|r]|h: gigabismila\",\"id\":\"s1_3770\",\"timestamp\":1772387813},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I will take this seed back to Silvermoon. Perhaps the Magisters will have some insight.\",\"id\":\"s1_3771\",\"timestamp\":1772387888},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Aramasu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aramasu-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Aramasu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61438:Player-1390-0D58EB43:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Thalassian Profession Master]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3772\",\"timestamp\":1772387973},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"name\":\"Aramasu-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Aramasu-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Aramasu|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42790:Player-1390-0D58EB43:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Skinning at Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3773\",\"timestamp\":1772387973},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: There you are. Unfortunately our fears were well-founded.\",\"id\":\"s1_3774\",\"timestamp\":1772387985},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:256203::::::::87:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:87:28:3087:::::|h[Light-Blighted Greaves]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3775\",\"timestamp\":1772388000},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: The elders will not sacrifice any of the Alndust. We must find another way.\",\"id\":\"s1_3776\",\"timestamp\":1772388027},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Ask around the Den. Glean what wisdom you can.\",\"id\":\"s1_3777\",\"timestamp\":1772388034},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ4:|Hitem:238475::::::::88:263::::1:28:3615:::::|h[Planting Shovel]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3778\",\"timestamp\":1772388177},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3260:0|h[Artisan Herbalist's Moxie]|h|rx15\",\"id\":\"s1_3779\",\"timestamp\":1772388182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ3:|Hcurrency:3154:0|h[Midnight Herbalism Knowledge]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s1_3780\",\"timestamp\":1772388182},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61387:Player-1390-0CD41AF9:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Prey: Normal Mode I]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3781\",\"timestamp\":1772388331},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:258947::::::::88:263::134:2:13730:6652:2:9:85:28:3322:::::|h[Tarnished Dawnlit Dagger]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3782\",\"timestamp\":1772388368},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:245853::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Seven of Rot]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3783\",\"timestamp\":1772388369},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Yinaa\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Yinaa says: Our traditions exist for a reason. They protect us and this land. It is not for the young to question.\",\"id\":\"s1_3784\",\"timestamp\":1772388421},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":1,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"r\":0.3333333432674408},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Herbalism has increased to 54.\",\"id\":\"s1_3785\",\"timestamp\":1772388522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236774::::::::88:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Azeroot |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"id\":\"s1_3786\",\"timestamp\":1772388522},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:257054::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[A Rolled-Up Pillow]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3787\",\"timestamp\":1772388555},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Mangousto-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mangousto-Hyjal|h[|cfffff468Mangousto|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62388:Player-1390-06DC4442:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Illicit Rain: Five Stars]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3788\",\"timestamp\":1772388556},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"You sense a nearby Skyriding Glyph.\",\"id\":\"s1_3789\",\"timestamp\":1772388566},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Spirit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Elder spirit is placing the rolled-up pillow on the altar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3790\",\"timestamp\":1772388603},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ2:|Hcurrency:3385:0|h[Luminous Dust]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s1_3791\",\"timestamp\":1772388660},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:257024::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[A Lost Hunting Knife]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3792\",\"timestamp\":1772388672},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Huntress Spirit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The hunter spirit puts the knife down on the altar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3793\",\"timestamp\":1772388691},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_CURRENCY\",\"type\":\"CURRENCY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive currency: |cnIQ2:|Hcurrency:3385:0|h[Luminous Dust]|h|rx1\",\"id\":\"s1_3794\",\"timestamp\":1772388718},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruia says: You would have us spare Alndust for the sake of outsiders? Absurd!\",\"id\":\"s1_3795\",\"timestamp\":1772388768},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ruia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ruia says: She of all people knows the cost to gather it. If she wants to waste it, then she can brave the rift for it herself.\",\"id\":\"s1_3796\",\"timestamp\":1772388775},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:256882::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[A Tattered Ball]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3797\",\"timestamp\":1772388811},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Child-Like Spirit\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"The Child-Like spirit is placing the ball down on the altar.\",\"id\":\"s1_3798\",\"timestamp\":1772388830},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Doecha\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Doecha says: I wish to help Orweyna, but she will not want to go where she must go.\",\"id\":\"s1_3799\",\"timestamp\":1772388915},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Orweyna, I beg you. You know where Alndust falls.\",\"id\":\"s1_3800\",\"timestamp\":1772388933},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Those who walk the rift without guidance risk being forever lost.\",\"id\":\"s1_3801\",\"timestamp\":1772388939},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: When the goddess was torn from her Cradle, the violence left wounds that will not heal.\",\"id\":\"s1_3802\",\"timestamp\":1772388954},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: Her screams of anguish give life to formless terrors and drive those who enter mad.\",\"id\":\"s1_3803\",\"timestamp\":1772388963},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Khennaï-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Khennaï-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKhennaï|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61913:Player-1390-0CEA7E58:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[A Singular Problem]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3804\",\"timestamp\":1772388982},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Vulpera\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Khennaï-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Khennaï-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKhennaï|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61922:Player-1390-0CEA7E58:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ninety Percent is Good Enough]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3805\",\"timestamp\":1772388982},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61644:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Heroic: Maisara Caverns]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3806\",\"timestamp\":1772389042},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ku'paal\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ku'paal says: If you must go, you will need the Shul'ka. How you feel about him cannot change that.\",\"id\":\"s1_3807\",\"timestamp\":1772389080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: I know, but neither does it change the past.\",\"id\":\"s1_3808\",\"timestamp\":1772389087},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: He was a friend, once. Before I followed the goddess's visions to the world above.\",\"id\":\"s1_3809\",\"timestamp\":1772389095},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: He was supposed to walk with us. But he chose the rift instead.\",\"id\":\"s1_3810\",\"timestamp\":1772389102},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: He turned his back on his friends. He closed his mind to the goddess.\",\"id\":\"s1_3811\",\"timestamp\":1772389109},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: And he chose to abandon me.\",\"id\":\"s1_3812\",\"timestamp\":1772389117},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ethereal Warpweaver says: I can see why you have summoned me, shaman.\",\"id\":\"s1_3813\",\"timestamp\":1772389236},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Orc\",\"class\":\"MONK\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul-Archimonde|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62270:Player-1302-0D33F4E1:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Altar of Blessings: One for Altar]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3814\",\"timestamp\":1772389252},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Human\",\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"name\":\"Mangousto-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Mangousto-Hyjal|h[|cfffff468Mangousto|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41960:Player-1390-06DC4442:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Murder Row]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_3815\",\"timestamp\":1772389293},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: After all this time, you return and seek entry into the rift? You have not changed at all, Orweyna.\",\"id\":\"s1_3816\",\"timestamp\":1772389552},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:243595::::::::88:263::11::1:28:3087:::::|h[Salve of Aln]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3817\",\"timestamp\":1772389614},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: If you insist on doing this, then you need to protect your mind and spirit with the Alndust.\",\"id\":\"s1_3818\",\"timestamp\":1772389640},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Amarakk\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Amarakk says: Find me once you are prepared. And Orweyna... Be careful.\",\"id\":\"s1_3819\",\"timestamp\":1772389647},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wounded Defender\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wounded Defender says: The quiet. I need the quiet.\",\"id\":\"s1_3820\",\"timestamp\":1772389651},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Wounded Defender\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Wounded Defender says: Argh--it's too much! She sings to me!\",\"id\":\"s1_3821\",\"timestamp\":1772389662},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260669::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Colorless Pebbles]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_3822\",\"timestamp\":1772389694},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:238417::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Diminished