na\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Without the Alndust, we face a grim task. Steel yourself.\",\"timestamp\":1772404463,\"id\":\"s1_4052\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I have brought what help I could.\",\"timestamp\":1772404489,\"id\":\"s1_4053\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: We used the last of the Alndust we gathered. What do you intend to do, Halduron?\",\"timestamp\":1772404533,\"id\":\"s1_4054\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Whatever I must.\",\"timestamp\":1772404539,\"id\":\"s1_4055\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61311:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Ready to Remodel]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772404549,\"id\":\"s1_4056\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999