ts. We have to--\",\"timestamp\":1772405428,\"id\":\"s1_4166\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Elder Hagar\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Elder Hagar says: Peace, Orweyna. Ruia will face judgment. Come, we should fall back to the Suncrown Tree.\",\"timestamp\":1772405433,\"id\":\"s1_4167\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:236770::::::::88:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Sanguithorn |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772405448,\"id\":\"s1_4168\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: With Ruia in retreat and Alndust in hand, we can drive the frenzy back.\",\"timestamp\":1772405594,\"id\":\"s1_4169\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ3:|Hitem:252957::::::::88:263::11:2:6652:13613:2:9:88:28:3087:::::|h[Tangle of Vibrant Vines]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772405606,\"id\":\"s1_4170\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Your people saved our home, Orweyna--and at great cost to yourselves. Your sacrifice shall not go unrecognized.\",\"timestamp\":1772405630,\"id\":\"s1_4171\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_SKILL\",\"type\":\"SKILL\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.3333333432674408,\"g\":0.3333333432674408,\"b\":1},\"text\":\"Your skill in Midnight Herbalism has increased to 66.\",\"timestamp\":1772405635,\"id\":\"s1_4172\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:236761::::::::88:263::::1:38:13:::::|h[Tranquility Bloom |A:Professions-ChatIcon-Quality-12-Tier1:17:15::1|a]|h|rx2\",\"timestamp\":1772405635,\"id\":\"s1_4173\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: I must insist you join me in Silvermoon.\",\"timestamp\":1772405639,\"id\":\"s1_4174\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Orweyna, your efforts saved Eversong this day. The haranir will always have a place in Silvermoon, should they wish it.\",\"timestamp\":1772405734,\"id\":\"s1_4175\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"name\":\"Kazex-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kazex-Hyjal|h[|cff33937fKazex|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-1390-0D5FDED4:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405758,\"id\":\"s1_4176\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Tauren\",\"name\":\"Santø-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Santø-Hyjal|h[|cffff7c0aSantø|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-1390-06D22CAF:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405760,\"id\":\"s1_4177\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405806,\"id\":\"s1_4178\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kvotheen-Hyjal|h[|cff0070ddKvotheen|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41804:Player-1390-09230B89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[One Does Not Simply Walk Into Harandar]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405806,\"id\":\"s1_4179\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Kvotheen, return to the Sanctum of Light. This struggle is far from over.\",\"timestamp\":1772405872,\"id\":\"s1_4180\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Orweyna\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Orweyna says: Thank you, Kvotheen. You helped bring my people back into the world. The goddess would be pleased, I think.\",\"timestamp\":1772405879,\"id\":\"s1_4181\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Who are these Vanguard people who keep taking our food?\",\"timestamp\":1772405911,\"id\":\"s1_4182\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: Lor'themar. What we saw out there. The Light drove the rutaani to zealotry and madness...\",\"timestamp\":1772405920,\"id\":\"s1_4183\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"name\":\"Kïrbi-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Kïrbi-Hyjal|h[|cffa330c9Kïrbi|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-1390-0C2F07B0:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405921,\"id\":\"s1_4184\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Watch your tone, Halduron. Blasphemy doesn't suit a man of your stature.\",\"timestamp\":1772405926,\"id\":\"s1_4185\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: He was speaking to his Lord-Regent.\",\"timestamp\":1772405931,\"id\":\"s1_4186\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We assume benevolent motives, but have seen the Light used by the wicked before. \",\"timestamp\":1772405934,\"id\":\"s1_4187\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: Without the Light, your precious city, all of Azeroth would have been lost!\",\"timestamp\":1772405940,\"id\":\"s1_4188\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"VoidElf\",\"name\":\"Bryhana-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Bryhana-Hyjal|h[|cffaad372Bryhana|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41802:Player-1390-0C114D89:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Eversong In Reprise]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405945,\"id\":\"s1_4189\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: No one is questioning the Light's grace, Turalyon. Least of all the sin'dorei!\",\"timestamp\":1772405945,\"id\":\"s1_4190\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Devaxrio-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Devaxrio-Hyjal|h[|cffa330c9Devaxrio|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-1390-0CA58721:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405948,\"id\":\"s1_4191\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Devaxrio-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Devaxrio-Hyjal|h[|cffa330c9Devaxrio|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-1390-0CA58721:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405948,\"id\":\"s1_4192\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We seek to avoid its--corruption. The Light being turned against us.\",\"timestamp\":1772405950,\"id\":\"s1_4193\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Halduron Brightwing\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Halduron Brightwing says: We are your friends, Turalyon--your family.\",\"timestamp\":1772405956,\"id\":\"s1_4194\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"High Exarch Turalyon\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"High Exarch Turalyon says: ...Family. Of course. The Lightbloom is an anomaly, but nothing that should diminish our faith in the Light.\",\"timestamp\":1772405960,\"id\":\"s1_4195\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Sunreaver Mage\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Sunreaver Mage says: You let the Alliance into our city? They killed so many of us!\",\"timestamp\":1772405961,\"id\":\"s1_4196\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Use discretion, Champion. We need both Umbric and the Vanguard.\",\"timestamp\":1772405983,\"id\":\"s1_4197\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Who rules Silvermoon? Is it Lor'themar? Or the fake King of Stormwind?\",\"timestamp\":1772405986,\"id\":\"s1_4198\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: The Sunwell holds for now, only through the constant effort of its defenders. Should their strength waver...\",\"timestamp\":1772405991,\"id\":\"s1_4199\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Hyperfougere-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hyperfougere-Hyjal|h[|cfffff468Hyperfougere|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-1390-0C4CADDD:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405992,\"id\":\"s1_4200\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Hyperfougere-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hyperfougere-Hyjal|h[|cfffff468Hyperfougere|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-1390-0C4CADDD:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405992,\"id\":\"s1_4201\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"ROGUE\",\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"name\":\"Hyperfougere-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Hyperfougere-Hyjal|h[|cfffff468Hyperfougere|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:61734:Player-1390-0C4CADDD:1:3:1:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight Delves: Endgame]|h|r!\",\"timestamp\":1772405992,\"id\":\"s1_4202\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: Bishop Alonsus Faol has a plan to support those at the Sunwell. And to help Arator.\",\"timestamp\":1772405999,\"id\":\"s1_4203\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Kvotheen! We're going to save the Sunwell. More importantly, we're going to fix that broken young man.\",\"timestamp\":1772406018,\"id\":\"s1_4204\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Why are the Alliance here?!\",\"timestamp\":1772406038,\"id\":\"s1_4205\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Such a troubled boy. That'll happen when your father leaves a gaping wound in your chest. Not to worry--I have a plan.\",\"timestamp\":1772406055,\"id\":\"s1_4206\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: I was investigating the Void to help you!\",\"timestamp\":1772406075,\"id\":\"s1_4207\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: We will not be tempted by your \\\"offers\\\" of help, Void elf.\",\"timestamp\":1772406079,\"id\":\"s1_4208\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Øskytankul-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Øskytankul-Archimonde:640:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Øskytankul|r]|h: bienvenue \",\"timestamp\":1772406146,\"id\":\"s1_4209\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate:641:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaDelondra|r]|h: Hello\",\"timestamp\":1772406149,\"id\":\"s1_4210\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARRIOR\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Grodar-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Grodar-Archimonde:642:GUILD:|h[|cffc69b6dGrodar|r]|h: Bienvenue\",\"timestamp\":1772406152,\"id\":\"s1_4211\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate:643:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaDelondra|r]|h: Et merci :)\",\"timestamp\":1772406154,\"id\":\"s1_4212\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:644:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: salut la pote a florii\",\"timestamp\":1772406156,\"id\":\"s1_4213\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MAGE\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Hitni-Archimonde\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Hitni-Archimonde:645:GUILD:|h[|cff3fc7ebHitni|r]|h: bienvenueeeeeeee\",\"timestamp\":1772406156,\"id\":\"s1_4214\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"}