651:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: gg\",\"timestamp\":1772406185,\"id\":\"s1_4219\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate:652:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaDelondra|r]|h: Palaheal c'est sans doute la seule classe heal que je n'aime pas^^\",\"timestamp\":1772406188,\"id\":\"s1_4220\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:653:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: palatank ? \",\"timestamp\":1772406201,\"id\":\"s1_4221\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:655:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: ou tu juge a grand coup de marterau\",\"timestamp\":1772406209,\"id\":\"s1_4222\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:656:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: ahh j'ai pas vue\",\"timestamp\":1772406218,\"id\":\"s1_4223\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:657:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: Desole\",\"timestamp\":1772406221,\"id\":\"s1_4224\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Delondra-LaCroisadeécarlate:658:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaDelondra|r]|h: A ccoup d'épée, mais l'idée reste la même :)\",\"timestamp\":1772406227,\"id\":\"s1_4225\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"DRUID\",\"race\":\"Worgen\",\"name\":\"Matrox-Eitrigg\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Matrox-Eitrigg:659:GUILD:|h[|cffff7c0aMatrox-Eitrigg|r]|h: ca va sanctifié fort\",\"timestamp\":1772406240,\"id\":\"s1_4226\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anduin Wrynn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Anduin Wrynn says: High Commander. You will release Magister Umbric, if you please.\",\"timestamp\":1772406292,\"id\":\"s1_4227\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: No. This... elf... has made their allegiance known.\",\"timestamp\":1772406296,\"id\":\"s1_4228\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anduin Wrynn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Anduin Wrynn says: They have. To me. Time and time again, Umbric and his ren'dorei have shown their loyalty to the alliance despite persecution and distrust.\",\"timestamp\":1772406303,\"id\":\"s1_4229\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anduin Wrynn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Anduin Wrynn says: You do not have the time to imprison him nor the grounds to execute him.\",\"timestamp\":1772406314,\"id\":\"s1_4230\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Grand Magister Rommath\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Grand Magister Rommath says: But Umbric-\",\"timestamp\":1772406319,\"id\":\"s1_4231\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anduin Wrynn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Anduin Wrynn says: Is fond of 'bold' actions. Is that what I heard you say, Grand Magister?\",\"timestamp\":1772406321,\"id\":\"s1_4232\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Anduin Wrynn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Anduin Wrynn says: Now is the time for bold actions. Release him, I accept full responsibility.\",\"timestamp\":1772406327,\"id\":\"s1_4233\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Fine. On your head be it.\",\"timestamp\":1772406334,\"id\":\"s1_4234\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: I can protect you in the city, but the Vanguard will not allow you to approach the Sunwell. Results will change that.\",\"timestamp\":1772406357,\"id\":\"s1_4235\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magister Umbric\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Magister Umbric says: Results? I have no tools, no support, and zealots on both sides hunting me...\",\"timestamp\":1772406364,\"id\":\"s1_4236\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lor'themar Theron\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lor'themar Theron says: If you found a pathway to Xal'atath, the Vanguard would leave. To say nothing of the power your people could acquire.\",\"timestamp\":1772406372,\"id\":\"s1_4237\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Why are the Void elves allowed anywhere near our city?\",\"timestamp\":1772406384,\"id\":\"s1_4238\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Why are the Void elves allowed anywhere near our city?\",\"timestamp\":1772406407,\"id\":\"s1_4239\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Why are the Alliance here?!\",\"id\":\"s1_4240\",\"timestamp\":1772437126},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: The quel'dorei are prowling on our southern border! When are you going to drive them off?\",\"id\":\"s1_4241\",\"timestamp\":1772437159},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Metrð-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Metrð-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaMetrð|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-1390-0B1B815D:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s1_4242\",\"timestamp\":1772437163},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"BloodElf\",\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"name\":\"Metrð-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Metrð-Hyjal|h[|cfff48cbaMetrð|r]|h has earned the achievement |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-1390-0B1B815D:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r!\",\"id\":\"s1_4243\",\"timestamp\":1772437163},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: You let the Alliance into our city? They killed so many of us!\",\"id\":\"s1_4244\",\"timestamp\":1772437173},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: Who rules Silvermoon? Is it Lor'themar? Or the fake King of Stormwind?\",\"id\":\"s1_4245\",\"timestamp\":1772437180},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Silvermoon Citizen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Silvermoon Citizen says: The quel'dorei are prowling on our southern border! When are you going to drive them off?\",\"id\":\"s1_4246\",\"timestamp\":1772437195},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Asking for me to inspire anyone? Faol always was an original thinker.\",\"id\":\"s1_4247\",\"timestamp\":1772437287},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Ah good! You're both here. There is a crisis of faith that we need to fix!\",\"id\":\"s1_4248\",\"timestamp\":1772437340},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ6:|Hitem:237811::::::::88:263::11::1:28:3088:::::|h[Faol's Benediction]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4249\",\"timestamp\":1772437414},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: That's your solution? To zap them with your staff?\",\"id\":\"s1_4250\",\"timestamp\":1772437414},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Hmmph. Those defenders have exhausted themselves, giving of their own faith and power. We bolster their reserves.\",\"id\":\"s1_4251\",\"timestamp\":1772437419},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: The Sunwell is a conduit for the Light! Made holy through the sacrifice of the naaru Mu'ru!\",\"id\":\"s1_4252\",\"timestamp\":1772437438},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: I know you are tired. It is hard to continue, but we must!\",\"id\":\"s1_4253\",\"timestamp\":1772437459},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"General Amias Bellamy\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"General Amias Bellamy says: I'm worried that Void Elf might sneak back in here and disrupt our efforts at the Sunwell.\",\"id\":\"s1_4254\",\"timestamp\":1772437475},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"War Chaplain Senn\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"War Chaplain Senn says: I have marshalled what priests were available to ward against the Void. It won't repel the Devouring Host, but will prevent contamination from any undesirable mortals.\",\"id\":\"s1_4255\",\"timestamp\":1772437481},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: Should the Sunwell fall, we have no way to stop the Devouring Host!\",\"id\":\"s1_4256\",\"timestamp\":1772437505},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Prophet Velen\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_YELL\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_YELL\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":0.250980406999588,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Prophet Velen yells: We have taken different paths to reach the Light, but together we assemble for the same purpose. To protect Azeroth!\",\"id\":\"s1_4257\",\"timestamp\":1772437521},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: What if I promised that my task would take you far away from here?\",\"id\":\"s1_4258\",\"timestamp\":1772437547},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:251277::::::::88:263::11:2:13573:6652:2:9:88:28:3088:::::|h[Hands of Renewal]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4259\",\"timestamp\":1772437570},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: You're creating a bigger cloud with your moping than Xal'atath's Voidstorm.\",\"id\":\"s1_4260\",\"timestamp\":1772437615},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Speak your mind! Let it out before these feelings create a well of poison in your gut.\",\"id\":\"s1_4261\",\"timestamp\":1772437622},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: I'm not just upset that my father cut me down.\",\"id\":\"s1_4262\",\"timestamp\":1772437630},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: I'm upset that when he did so... I saw the Light shining brightly in his eyes.\",\"id\":\"s1_4263\",\"timestamp\":1772437634},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: The same Light that I am taught to revere. Under its guidance, he almost killed me.\",\"id\":\"s1_4264\",\"timestamp\":1772437641},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: So you blame the Light, not your father?\",\"id\":\"s1_4265\",\"timestamp\":1772437649},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: We are trained to wield the Light as a weapon. Is that all that I am as a paladin?\",\"id\":\"s1_4266\",\"timestamp\":1772437655},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: You founded the Silver Hand. You trained my father. I suppose I blame you as well.\",\"id\":\"s1_4267\",\"timestamp\":1772437660},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: You crafted this philosophy of war. I followed your teachings until I burned myself with my own wrath.\",\"id\":\"s1_4268\",\"timestamp\":1772437667},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"Dracthyr\",\"class\":\"EVOKER\",\"name\":\"Voltarynn-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Voltarynn-Dalaran|h[|cff33937fVoltarynn-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42795:Player-1621-0B3D5570:1:3:2:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Cooking at Midnight]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_4269\",\"timestamp\":1772437674},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Well, I think you're absolutely right. I really did make a mess of it all, didn't I?\",\"id\":\"s1_4270\",\"timestamp\":1772437676},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: What?\",\"id\":\"s1_4271\",\"timestamp\":1772437684},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: I'm reminded of each and every one of my failings every day when the Light burns me as I channel it.\",\"id\":\"s1_4272\",\"timestamp\":1772437686},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: What are you saying?\",\"id\":\"s1_4273\",\"timestamp\":1772437696},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: In many ways, this world is broken. You should feel angry about it.\",\"id\":\"s1_4274\",\"timestamp\":1772437698},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: That doesn't mean you can't try to change the world, or yourself, for the better.\",\"id\":\"s1_4275\",\"timestamp\":1772437706},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: Come with me on my little quest. I can't promise we'll change anything but how you feel.\",\"id\":\"s1_4276\",\"timestamp\":1772437713},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: But that's the only thing we can control.\",\"id\":\"s1_4277\",\"timestamp\":1772437722},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alonsus Faol\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Alonsus Faol says: To Light's Hope to gather relics and inspire the Vanguard.\",\"id\":\"s1_4278\",\"timestamp\":1772437732},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: No better place to take my mind off the problems with paladins.\",\"id\":\"s1_4279\",\"timestamp\":1772437738},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:21100::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Coin of Ancestry]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4280\",\"timestamp\":1772438080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ1:|Hitem:21746::::::::88:263::11::1:28:401:::::|h[Lucky Red Envelope]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4281\",\"timestamp\":1772438080},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: Lord Tyrosus, I had no idea things were so desperate. What can we do to help?\",\"id\":\"s1_4282\",\"timestamp\":1772438086},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus says: With so many defenders called away to the Sunwell, the Scourge almost broke through to the chapel.\",\"id\":\"s1_4283\",\"timestamp\":1772438190},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Maxwell Tyrosus says: I've called for assistance from the Ebon Blade, but we could use your help pushing back this latest attack.\",\"id\":\"s1_4284\",\"timestamp\":1772438198},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|r\",\"id\":\"s1_4285\",\"timestamp\":1772438215},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260660::::::::88:263:::::::::|h[Putrid Mushroom Spores]|h|rx3\",\"id\":\"s1_4286\",\"timestamp\":1772438215},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Arator says: I fear if I were stationed here to fight the Scourge, I'd become just like my fath--I'd fall to rage and wrath.\",\"id\":\"s1_4287\",\"timestamp\":1772438230},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"r\"