":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: We were--We are. He's not wrong to distrust the Void. I only wish he would trust me.\",\"timestamp\":1772559304,\"id\":\"s1_4344\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Gabodémo-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Gabodémo-Dalaran|h[|cff8788eeGabodémo-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:41806:Player-1621-0BA8CD33:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Breaching the Voidstorm]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772559309,\"id\":\"s1_4345\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"WARLOCK\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Gabodémo-Dalaran\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Gabodémo-Dalaran|h[|cff8788eeGabodémo-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:42045:Player-1621-0BA8CD33:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Midnight]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772559309,\"id\":\"s1_4346\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ravenia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ravenia says: I will bring these ingredients to the cauldron, but you will do the cooking.\",\"timestamp\":1772559372,\"id\":\"s1_4347\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ravenia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ravenia says: I've placed the ingredients on these tables. You will perform the cooking. And the feeding. And the caring for the creature afterward.\",\"timestamp\":1772559382,\"id\":\"s1_4348\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Come, Kvotheen. I have so much to show you.\",\"timestamp\":1772559383,\"id\":\"s1_4349\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ravenia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ravenia says: Feed the beast and then take him around the ridge so he can exercise... his dominance.\",\"timestamp\":1772559392,\"id\":\"s1_4350\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ravenia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ravenia says: After you've finished, I will meet you back near my beasts.\",\"timestamp\":1772559398,\"id\":\"s1_4351\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Borrow my pet's sight. I'll tell you how to weaken the storm.\",\"timestamp\":1772559440,\"id\":\"s1_4352\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Arator\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Arator says: Why are you so eager to help us?\",\"timestamp\":1772559448,\"id\":\"s1_4353\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: I am a creature of passion.\",\"timestamp\":1772559451,\"id\":\"s1_4354\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: A creature without purpose. Like every fiend from the Void.\",\"timestamp\":1772559456,\"id\":\"s1_4355\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Watching your struggles blazing bright against an uncaring cosmos--it's delicious.\",\"timestamp\":1772559463,\"id\":\"s1_4356\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Xal'atath would devour your world. All worlds. Even the stars.\",\"timestamp\":1772559473,\"id\":\"s1_4357\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: She would leave nothing but an empty abyss. Can you imagine anything more dull?\",\"timestamp\":1772559482,\"id\":\"s1_4358\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Loyalty is so contrary to the Void that you'd betray your master out of boredom?\",\"timestamp\":1772559491,\"id\":\"s1_4359\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: I need no master. We should all obey our own appetites.\",\"timestamp\":1772559498,\"id\":\"s1_4360\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Some of us serve greater purposes than hunger, beast.\",\"timestamp\":1772559508,\"id\":\"s1_4361\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: The cosmos is a feast, lightling. Why not enjoy it?\",\"timestamp\":1772559515,\"id\":\"s1_4362\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: The key to weakening the storm is an artifact known as the Mantle of Predation.\",\"timestamp\":1772559569,\"id\":\"s1_4363\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: With it, you may enter a Nexus-Point and simply shut it down. Doing so will nullify the others in a cascade.\",\"timestamp\":1772559577,\"id\":\"s1_4364\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: Why merely shut down the Nexus-Points? We should raze them from within.\",\"timestamp\":1772559590,\"id\":\"s1_4365\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: And cause an energy surge that would obliterate precious Silvermoon? Shut them down safely--spare your poor city.\",\"timestamp\":1772559598,\"id\":\"s1_4366\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: \\\"Lord\\\" Terminas. He keeps the Mantle at the Obscurion Citadel.\",\"timestamp\":1772559617,\"id\":\"s1_4367\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: How fortunate that he's busy here, leaving his vault unguarded.\",\"timestamp\":1772559625,\"id\":\"s1_4368\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Terminas\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Terminas says: Hello little morsel. How did you drift so close?\",\"timestamp\":1772559632,\"id\":\"s1_4369\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive item: |cnIQ2:|Hitem:260859::::::::90:263::60:2:13573:13668:2:9:90:28:3084:::::|h[Thorny Necklace]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772559672,\"id\":\"s1_4370\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Steal the Mantle of Predation, enter a Nexus-Point, and weaken the storm. Oh, Terminas will be humiliated.\",\"timestamp\":1772559672,\"id\":\"s1_4371\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: Make haste. We should have the Mantle before Terminas returns to his citadel.\",\"timestamp\":1772559835,\"id\":\"s1_4372\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"HUNTER\",\"race\":\"Orc\",\"name\":\"Justhunt-Ysondre\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Justhunt-Ysondre|h[|cffaad372Justhunt-Ysondre|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:61506:Player-1335-06F2340A:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Allied Race: Haranir]|h|r !\",\"timestamp\":1772559849,\"id\":\"s1_4373\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fidoficus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Fidoficus roars confidently at the tiny blistercreeps.\",\"timestamp\":1772559851,\"id\":\"s1_4374\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"MONK\",\"race\":\"Human\",\"name\":\"Sânghr-Hyjal\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Sânghr-Hyjal:86:GUILD:|h[|cff00ff98Sânghr|r]|h: yoooo\",\"timestamp\":1772559855,\"id\":\"s1_4375\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fidoficus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Fidoficus postures ferociously at the void elves.\",\"timestamp\":1772559865,\"id\":\"s1_4376\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ren'dorei Scout\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ren'dorei Scout says: He's really doing his best!\",\"timestamp\":1772559869,\"id\":\"s1_4377\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Fidoficus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_EMOTE\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_EMOTE\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":0.501960813999176,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"Fido pauses, then cowers in front of the toothy bones.\",\"timestamp\":1772559880,\"id\":\"s1_4378\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ravenia\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Ravenia says: Fidoficus is ready to prove himself. Meet him at the creature's den to the south and witness the ferocity we've cultivated.\",\"timestamp\":1772559913,\"id\":\"s1_4379\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: In his absence, Terminas's lieutenants control access to his vault.\",\"timestamp\":1772559932,\"id\":\"s1_4380\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: Torentia controls the trench, Severum guards the upper citadel.\",\"timestamp\":1772559941,\"id\":\"s1_4381\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lothraxion\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Lothraxion says: I'll hunt down Severum. You and this voidspawn can handle the trench.\",\"timestamp\":1772559946,\"id\":\"s1_4382\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Alleria Windrunner\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Alleria Windrunner says: This is no time to go off on your own!\",\"timestamp\":1772559952,\"id\":\"s1_4383\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Riftblade Maella\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Riftblade Maella says: We'll follow him, my lady. Ren'dorei, with me.\",\"timestamp\":1772559955,\"id\":\"s1_4384\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"PALADIN\",\"race\":\"EarthenDwarf\",\"name\":\"Yapludruhm-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD\",\"type\":\"GUILD\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hchannel:GUILD|h[Guild]|h |Hplayer:Yapludruhm-Hyjal:104:GUILD:|h[|cfff48cbaYapludruhm|r]|h: yo\",\"timestamp\":1772559975,\"id\":\"s1_4385\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Decimus\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"r\":1,\"g\":1,\"b\":0.6235294342041016},\"text\":\"Decimus says: Break her toys and fight to the top of the food chain. Dear little Torentia will take it as a challenge.\",\"timestamp\":1772560002,\"id\":\"s1_4386\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\":2},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_LOOT\",\"type\":\"LOOT\"},\"color\":{\"r\":0,\"g\":0.6666666865348816,\"b\":0},\"text\":\"You receive loot: |cnIQ0:|Hitem:260659::::::::90:263:::::::::|h[Stellar Vortex Residue]|h|r\",\"timestamp\":1772560029,\"id\":\"s1_4387\"},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"class\":\"SHAMAN\",\"race\":\"ZandalariTroll\",\"name\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"sex\"