"Knight-Lord Sunguard says: I despise this way of operating. But the Blood Knights will need resources for this war, so let us get on with it.\",\"id\":\"s1_4911\",\"timestamp\":1772568221},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Magistrix Bloodflame says: My dear, I would have attended even without his invitation. He and I have played this game for the aristocracy many times now. I will get my things.\",\"id\":\"s1_4912\",\"timestamp\":1772568249},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"race\":\"NightElf\",\"class\":\"DEMONHUNTER\",\"name\":\"Vilidøns-Dalaran\",\"sex\":3},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\",\"type\":\"GUILD_ACHIEVEMENT\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.250980406999588,\"g\":1,\"r\":0.250980406999588},\"text\":\"|Hplayer:Vilidøns-Dalaran|h[|cffa330c9Vilidøns-Dalaran|r]|h a accompli le haut fait |cffffff00|Hachievement:62202:Player-1621-0AE26419:1:3:3:26:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295:4294967295|h[Spiritpaw Marathon]|h|r !\",\"id\":\"s1_4913\",\"timestamp\":1772568290},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Ranger-Captain Dawnfletch says: This is for the war bonds party? Alright. I can spend some time rubbing elbows to get some noble gold in Farstrider coffers.\",\"id\":\"s1_4914\",\"timestamp\":1772568315},{\"recordedBy\":\"Kvotheen-Hyjal\",\"typeInfo\":{\"player\":{\"name\":\"Lord Saltheril\"},\"event\":\"CHAT_MSG_MONSTER_SAY\",\"type\":\"MONSTER_SAY\"},\"color\":{\"b\":0.6235294342041016,\"g\":1,\"r\":1},\"text\":\"Lord Saltheril says: Ah, sin'dorei politics at their finest are a sight to behold, are they not?\",\"id\":\"s1_4915\",\"timestamp\":1772568358},{\"recordedB